<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I'm sorry to hear that.</font>

193
00:22:40.758 --> 00:22:44.635
<font color="#ffff00">It's okay. I'm back to me, and my work.</font>

194
00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:46.159
<font color="#ffff00">And now it's...</font>

195
00:22:46.357 --> 00:22:48.676
<font color="#ffff00">-That's great.
-That's good. It is.</font>

196
00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:50.169
<font color="#ffff00">I'm alone at last.</font>

197
00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:51.843
<font color="#ffff00">Exciting times.</font>

198
00:22:51.927 --> 00:22:54.490
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I'm living that Alan Grant life.</font>

199
00:22:54.574 --> 00:22:56.152
<font color="#ffff00">-It's just...
-Can be lonely.</font>

200
00:22:56.236 --> 00:22:57.427
<font color="#ffff00">So free.</font>

201
00:23:00.544 --> 00:23:01.846
<font color="#ffff00">Ellie...</font>

202
00:23:03.393 --> 00:23:07.376
<font color="#ffff00">You didn't come out all this way
just to catch up now, did you?</font>

203
00:23:11.645 --> 00:23:15.830
<font color="#ffff00">It's a locust.
Mandibles, wings, thorax, but...</font>

204
00:23:16.727 --> 00:23:18.619
<font color="#ffff00">God, the size of it is massive.</font>

205
00:23:20.482 --> 00:23:23.212
<font color="#ffff00">It has genes that had been extinct
since the Cretaceous.</font>

206
00:23:23.695 --> 00:23:27.044
<font color="#ffff00">And swarms of them are decimating
crops from Iowa to Texas.</font>

207
00:23:28.098 --> 00:23:29.296
<font color="#ffff00">Terrifying, right?</font>

208
00:23:30.292 --> 00:23:31.727
<font color="#ffff00">Started as a few hundred.</font>

209
00:23:31.887 --> 00:23:34.248
<font color="#ffff00">It could be millions
by the end of this summer.</font>

210
00:23:34.346 --> 00:23:38.303
<font color="#ffff00">If they keep going there will be no grain
to feed chickens, cattle.</font>

211
00:23:38.387 --> 00:23:40.558
<font color="#ffff00">The entire food chain would collapse.</font>

212
00:23:40.642 --> 00:23:44.318
<font color="#ffff00">Well, it's clearly designed,
but why would anyone do that?</font>

213
00:23:45.742 --> 00:23:50.113
<font color="#ffff00">None of the crops they're eating
are Biosyn seed.</font>

214
00:23:50.197 --> 00:23:51.148
<font color="#ffff00">Biosyn.</font>

215
00:23:52.182 --> 00:23:53.645
<font color="#ffff00">You're saying Biosyn made this?</font>

216
00:23:54.092 --> 00:23:58.240
<font color="#ffff00">It would not shock me that they wanna
control the world's food supply.</font>

217
00:23:58.323 --> 00:24:01.612
<font color="#ffff00">-Not before a few millions starve.
-Now, what is that saying?</font>

218
00:24:01.696 --> 00:24:04.605
<font color="#ffff00">"We are three meals away from anarchy."</font>

219
00:24:04.689 --> 00:24:07.738
<font color="#ffff00">If we don't stop them
you can pick your last three meals.</font>

220
00:24:10.206 --> 00:24:12.288
<font color="#ffff00">So, why are you bringing it to me?</font>

221
00:24:12.575 --> 00:24:15.712
<font color="#ffff00">I need concrete evidence
Biosyn's responsible for all this.</font>

222
00:24:15.817 --> 00:24:20.033
<font color="#ffff00">I need to go to their sanctuary
and get DNA from another locust there.</font>

223
00:24:21.656 --> 00:24:23.359
<font color="#ffff00">But I need a witness.</font>

224
00:24:24.187 --> 00:24:25.310
<font color="#ffff00">Alan...</font>

225
00:24:26.432 --> 00:24:28.620
<font color="#ffff00">You command respect. People believe you.</font>

226
00:24:29.282 --> 00:24:30.543
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

227
00:24:30.627 --> 00:24:33.787
<font color="#ffff00">You know why I'm here?
It's quiet. I'm done with all of that.</font>

228
00:24:33.871 --> 00:24:35.372
<font color="#ffff00">Are you? Okay.</font>

229
00:24:36.107 --> 00:24:41.067
<font color="#ffff00">Well, I'm sorry, Alan. Nobody gets
that luxury anymore, not even you.</font>

230
00:24:41.540 --> 00:24:42.464
<font color="#ffff00">And you know what?</font>

231
00:24:43.987 --> 00:24:45.815
<font color="#ffff00">You are the one I trust.</font>

232
00:24:49.548 --> 00:24:53.382
<font color="#ffff00">This Biosyn's sanctuary is what,
a hundred miles from anywhere?</font>

233
00:24:53.476 --> 00:24:54.787
<font color="#ffff00">How would you even get in there?</font>

234
00:24:54.925 --> 00:24:58.911
<font color="#ffff00">I got an invite
from their in-house philosopher.</font>

235
00:24:59.986 --> 00:25:02.829
<font color="#ffff00">Seems there's a lot of money
in being a chaotician these days.</font>

236
00:25:02.913 --> 00:25:06.387
<font color="#ffff00">And he just happen to invite you
out of the blue?</font>

237
00:25:07.387 --> 00:25:09.740
<font color="#ffff00">He said there were things I'd wanna see.</font>

238
00:25:16.328 --> 00:25:17.402
<font color="#ffff00">You coming or what?</font>

239
00:25:21.310 --> 00:25:23.540
<font color="#ffff00">U.S. WILDLIFE RELOCATION FACILITY
PENNSYLVANIA</font>

240
00:25:24.263 --> 00:25:25.356
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>

241
00:25:26.311 --> 00:25:27.584
<font color="#ffff00">It's clear!</font>

242
00:25:32.404 --> 00:25:35.007
<font color="#ffff00">Every animal captured on the mainland
comes through here</font>

243
00:25:35.091 --> 00:25:37.796
<font color="#ffff00">before shipping out
to Biosyn's sanctuary in Dolomites.</font>

244
00:25:37.897 --> 00:25:41.339
<font color="#ffff00">We give them the medical attention
and make sure they live healthy.</font>

245
00:25:41.422 --> 00:25:44.666
<font color="#ffff00">-So much security.
-Those are just the ones you see.</font>

246
00:25:45.007 --> 00:25:47.309
<font color="#ffff00">A lot of shady types out there
want these guys.</font>

247
00:25:49.636 --> 00:25:51.204
<font color="#ffff00">Your plane is just fueling up.</font>

248
00:25:52.675 --> 00:25:55.225
<font color="#ffff00">Biosyn's a tough invite,
you guys must know somebody.</font>

249
00:25:55.309 --> 00:25:56.833
<font color="#ffff00">-Do you mind if I...
-Of course.</font>

250
00:25:59.084 --> 00:26:00.333
<font color="#ffff00">Hi there.</font>

251
00:26:02.455 --> 00:26:03.646
<font color="#ffff00">Follow me.</font>

252
00:26:03.730 --> 00:26:07.322
<font color="#ffff00">We rescued these guys from an illegal
breeding farm in Nevada a few weeks ago.</font>

253
00:26:07.782 --> 00:26:10.452
<font color="#ffff00">Shut the whole place down. Anonymous tip.</font>

254
00:26:11.546 --> 00:26:14.461
<font color="#ffff00">Good girl. Yes, yes.</font>

255
00:26:15.928 --> 00:26:19.383
<font color="#ffff00">Alan, you never get used to it.</font>

256
00:26:20.368 --> 00:26:21.783
<font color="#ffff00">-Take care. Thank you.
- Bye.</font>

257
00:26:59.793 --> 00:27:00.992
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

258
00:27:03.028 --> 00:27:04.686
<font color="#ffff00">You look just like Blue.</font>

259
00:27:05.655 --> 00:27:07.137
<font color="#ffff00">Is she your mother?</font>

260
00:27:09.045 --> 00:27:11.491
<font color="#ffff00">This? You wanna try it?</font>

261
00:27:12.419 --> 00:27:13.253
<font color="#ffff00">Okay.</font>

262
00:27:28.453 --> 00:27:30.348
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie, don't move..</font>

263
00:27:33.273 --> 00:27:36.535
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, girl. Staying out of trouble?</font>

264
00:27:37.535 --> 00:27:39.417
<font color="#ffff00">She had a baby. That's impossible.</font>

265
00:27:42.386 --> 00:27:44.874
<font color="#ffff00">-Back up.
-She won't hurt us, right?</font>

266
00:27:44.969 --> 00:27:47.414
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, you damn right she will. Just breathe.</font>

267
00:27:47.849 --> 00:27:49.471
<font color="#ffff00">If you don't she'll think you're scared.</font>

268
00:27:49.555 --> 00:27:50.785
<font color="#ffff00">I am scared.</font>

269
00:27:51.739 --> 00:27:53.855
<font color="#ffff00">She doesn't need to know that.</font>

270
00:28:01.559 --> 00:28:04.534
<font color="#ffff00">Her nest has got to be nearby.
Maisie get inside.</font>

271
00:28:04.618 --> 00:28:06.632
<font color="#ffff00">-I'm coming with you.
-What did I just say?</font>

272
00:28:17.015 --> 00:28:19.611
<font color="#ffff00">-We gotta move.
<i>- Not yet, we need the girl.</i></font>

273
00:28:21.918 --> 00:28:23.591
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, what's up?</font>

274
00:28:27.017 --> 00:28:28.318
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie?</font>

275
00:28:29.146 --> 00:28:30.594
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie?</font>

276
00:28:36.630 --> 00:28:38.059
<font color="#ffff00">Where are you going?</font>

277
00:28:38.143 --> 00:28:40.114
<font color="#ffff00">You can't keep me here,
you're not my mother.</font>

278
00:28:46.344 --> 00:28:47.965
<font color="#ffff00">She's leaving the house.</font>

279
00:29:15.017 --> 00:29:16.471
<font color="#ffff00">-Time to go!
-Come on let's go!</font>

280
00:29:42.661 --> 00:29:44.193
<font color="#ffff00">Who are you?</font>

281
00:30:05.347 --> 00:30:06.582
<font color="#ffff00">Claire!</font>

282
00:30:07.189 --> 00:30:08.200
<font color="#ffff00">They found her.</font>

283
00:30:08.284 --> 00:30:09.732
<font color="#ffff00">What? Who are they?</font>

284
00:30:09.816 --> 00:30:12.233
<font color="#ffff00">Poachers, I've seen them around.</font>

285
00:30:12.317 --> 00:30:13.656
<font color="#ffff00">Leader's a real shit heel.</font>

286
00:30:13.757 --> 00:30:15.953
<font color="#ffff00">He must have recognized me,
followed me here.</font>

287
00:30:16.583 --> 00:30:18.137
<font color="#ffff00">-Where is she?
-Go get the truck.</font>

288
00:30:18.221 --> 00:30:19.418
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God.</font>

289
00:30:27.125 --> 00:30:28.082
<font color="#ffff00">Owen!</font>

290
00:30:28.167 --> 00:30:29.541
<font color="#ffff00">Hey! No.</font>

291
00:30:34.202 --> 00:30:36.274
<font color="#ffff00">They took her kid too.</font>

292
00:30:39.399 --> 00:30:43.368
<font color="#ffff00">I am gonna get her back.
I promise you that.</font>

293
00:30:53.989 --> 00:30:56.449
<font color="#ffff00">Come on. I know whom to call.</font>

294
00:31:05.988 --> 00:31:08.754
<font color="#ffff00">CENTRAL INTELLIGENCE AGENCY
DANGEROUS SPECIES DIVISION</font>

295
00:31:15.935 --> 00:31:17.686
<font color="#ffff00">This year, man. What's next?</font>

296
00:31:17.770 --> 00:31:21.277
<font color="#ffff00">Historically? Darkness, blood,
reign of fire.</font>

297
00:31:21.361 --> 00:31:22.381
<font color="#ffff00">I think frogs.</font>

298
00:31:22.465 --> 00:31:24.433
<font color="#ffff00">We're not gonna be around
for much longer anyway.</font>

299
00:31:24.517 --> 00:31:26.369
<font color="#ffff00">These locusts in Nebraska
are about to wrap it up.</font>

300
00:31:26.453 --> 00:31:27.601
<font color="#ffff00">They're in the corn, wheat.</font>

301
00:31:27.685 --> 00:31:29.791
<font color="#ffff00">Basically whole of our food
and our food's food, so...</font>

302
00:31:29.875 --> 00:31:31.186
<font color="#ffff00">We can say goodbye to this.</font>

303
00:31:34.865 --> 00:31:37.765
<font color="#ffff00">-Hello?
<i>- Franklin, it's me. You're at work?</i></font>

304
00:31:38.503 --> 00:31:40.315
<font color="#ffff00">You're kinda subject of interest
around here,</font>

305
00:31:40.399 --> 00:31:42.122
<font color="#ffff00">so I can't really be talking to you.</font>

306
00:31:42.207 --> 00:31:44.824
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Come, on, I'm in trouble.
I really need your help. Please.</i></font>

307
00:31:44.908 --> 00:31:46.123
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, and I could lose my job,</font>

308
00:31:46.221 --> 00:31:48.221
<font color="#ffff00">and you know I'm not qualified
