309
00:31:48.305 --> 00:31:49.454
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We're outside.</i></font>

310
00:31:51.663 --> 00:31:53.038
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Let me talk to him.</i></font>

311
00:31:56.997 --> 00:31:59.042
<font color="#ffff00">-Is that him?
-That's him.</font>

312
00:31:59.126 --> 00:32:02.800
<font color="#ffff00">Name's Rainn Delacourt.
A real piece of work.</font>

313
00:32:03.372 --> 00:32:04.593
<font color="#ffff00">What did he take?</font>

314
00:32:05.357 --> 00:32:07.352
<font color="#ffff00">Something we care about very much.</font>

315
00:32:08.146 --> 00:32:11.228
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, shit. I told you somebody
