316
00:32:11.313 --> 00:32:12.880
<font color="#ffff00">You can't just take a person, Claire.</font>

317
00:32:12.964 --> 00:32:14.936
<font color="#ffff00">-I had no choice.
-Not in the eyes of the law.</font>

318
00:32:15.033 --> 00:32:17.894
<font color="#ffff00">This guy is not the "law."
Tell us how to find him.</font>

319
00:32:19.729 --> 00:32:21.605
<font color="#ffff00">What did you guys call me from?</font>

320
00:32:23.323 --> 00:32:25.751
<font color="#ffff00">We have a man on the inside
of Delacourt's operation.</font>

321
00:32:25.835 --> 00:32:28.411
<font color="#ffff00">There's an exchange in Malta
