328
00:32:47.228 --> 00:32:49.071
<font color="#ffff00">Look, once we make the bust in Malta</font>

329
00:32:49.155 --> 00:32:51.160
<font color="#ffff00">our guys will see if Delacourt knows
where she is.</font>

330
00:32:51.645 --> 00:32:53.927
<font color="#ffff00">Our guys, not you.</font>

331
00:32:54.399 --> 00:32:58.668
<font color="#ffff00">Promise me you won't go in there
