332
00:32:59.829 --> 00:33:00.944
<font color="#ffff00">Why would I do that?</font>

333
00:33:02.321 --> 00:33:05.043
<font color="#ffff00">Look, you guys are both crazy.</font>

334
00:33:05.927 --> 00:33:09.037
<font color="#ffff00">But you seem like you're good parents,
