335
00:33:09.536 --> 00:33:10.657
<font color="#ffff00">She's lucky to have you.</font>

336
00:33:12.673 --> 00:33:14.393
<font color="#ffff00">Don't get killed, okay?</font>

337
00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:34.306
<font color="#ffff00">I think we're almost there.</font>

338
00:33:35.462 --> 00:33:36.336
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

339
00:33:37.159 --> 00:33:40.794
<font color="#ffff00">BIOSYN SANCTUARY
DOLOMITE MOUNTAINS, ITALY</font>

340
00:33:49.842 --> 00:33:53.119
<font color="#ffff00">Dr. Sattler, Dr. Grant,
Ramsay Cole, Communications.</font>

341
00:33:53.203 --> 00:33:54.137
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, hey.</font>

342
00:33:54.221 --> 00:33:56.513
<font color="#ffff00">I have to warn you,
everyone is so excited to have you.</font>

343
00:33:56.613 --> 00:33:59.181
<font color="#ffff00">You guys are absolute legends around here.</font>

344
00:33:59.594 --> 00:34:01.964
<font color="#ffff00">You must be confusing us
