347
00:34:08.021 --> 00:34:10.496
<font color="#ffff00">but he's exactly the way
you'd want him to be.</font>

348
00:34:10.580 --> 00:34:12.658
<font color="#ffff00">Such motility of thought, it's incredible.</font>

349
00:34:12.742 --> 00:34:14.310
<font color="#ffff00">How much time did you spend with him?</font>

350
00:34:16.369 --> 00:34:19.027
<font color="#ffff00">Well, I know that was sarcastic,
but honestly, not enough.</font>

351
00:34:19.111 --> 00:34:21.192
<font color="#ffff00">Please, after you. And watch your head.</font>

352
00:34:28.383 --> 00:34:31.279
<font color="#ffff00">So, Biosyn bought this land for the amber
deposits back in the nineties,</font>

353
00:34:31.363 --> 00:34:33.167
<font color="#ffff00">but we've managed to turn into
a safe haven</font>

354
00:34:33.267 --> 00:34:34.978
<font color="#ffff00">for about 20 displaced species.</font>

355
00:34:35.305 --> 00:34:38.803
<font color="#ffff00">The first generation came from Sorna.
Most of the Nublar dinosaurs are here too.</font>

356
00:34:39.143 --> 00:34:41.744
<font color="#ffff00">Took Fish and Wildlife three years
to catch the T-Rex.</font>

357
00:34:42.517 --> 00:34:44.412
<font color="#ffff00">The T-Rex is here?</font>

358
00:34:44.619 --> 00:34:46.367
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yeah. Yeah.</font>

359
00:34:47.163 --> 00:34:49.232
<font color="#ffff00">Arrived just before you guys.</font>

360
00:35:06.307 --> 00:35:09.162
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Aerial deterrent system - active.</i></font>

361
00:35:09.543 --> 00:35:12.330
<font color="#ffff00">Restricted aerial space.
Protects the airborne life.</font>

362
00:35:12.691 --> 00:35:14.760
<font color="#ffff00">Keeps the Pterosaurs below 500 feet.</font>

363
00:35:14.973 --> 00:35:16.128
<font color="#ffff00">Airborne?</font>

364
00:35:18.614 --> 00:35:20.423
<font color="#ffff00">Is that Dreadnoughtus?</font>

365
00:35:21.164 --> 00:35:22.145
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

366
00:35:29.258 --> 00:35:30.660
<font color="#ffff00">Beautiful, right?</font>

367
00:35:31.160 --> 00:35:34.744
<font color="#ffff00">Her name means "fear nothing."
I guess you know that.</font>

368
00:35:35.310 --> 00:35:37.192
<font color="#ffff00">-What do they graze on?
-All thorn and fern.</font>

369
00:35:37.651 --> 00:35:41.040
<font color="#ffff00">All indigenous, nothing stocked,
except for the deer population.</font>

370
00:35:41.124 --> 00:35:43.636
<font color="#ffff00">It's a great mesenchyme species
for the apex predator.</font>

371
00:35:44.433 --> 00:35:47.704
<font color="#ffff00">-The apex predator?
-Giganotosaurus.</font>

372
00:35:48.998 --> 00:35:50.290
<font color="#ffff00">At least for now.</font>

373
00:36:00.100 --> 00:36:03.220
<font color="#ffff00">You don't let people in there, right?</font>

374
00:36:03.626 --> 00:36:08.910
<font color="#ffff00">No. Our research outposts
are connected completely underground.</font>

375
00:36:09.008 --> 00:36:11.767
<font color="#ffff00">If we have to we can just
herd the animals remotely</font>

376
00:36:11.851 --> 00:36:16.154
<font color="#ffff00">using neural implant that sends
