377
00:36:16.238 --> 00:36:18.323
<font color="#ffff00">Like shocks?</font>

378
00:36:18.407 --> 00:36:20.005
<font color="#ffff00">No, like signals.</font>

379
00:36:20.687 --> 00:36:23.197
<font color="#ffff00">Does it strike you as a little bit...</font>

380
00:36:23.304 --> 00:36:24.364
<font color="#ffff00">-Cruel?
-Cruel.</font>

381
00:36:25.272 --> 00:36:28.669
<font color="#ffff00">Do you know how much voltage was
in the electric fences at Jurassic Park?</font>

382
00:36:30.130 --> 00:36:31.131
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

383
00:36:36.936 --> 00:36:38.878
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Please join Dr. Ian Malcolm at noon</i></font>

384
00:36:38.962 --> 00:36:41.441
<font color="#ffff00"><i>in the lecture hall
