to anyone. Just try to blend in.</font>

579
00:48:44.086 --> 00:48:45.089
<font color="#ffff00">I'm okay.</font>

580
00:48:56.959 --> 00:49:00.656
<font color="#ffff00">Still flying for Santos, huh?
You must need money.</font>

581
00:49:00.740 --> 00:49:02.010
<font color="#ffff00">What's it to you?</font>

582
00:49:02.093 --> 00:49:03.741
<font color="#ffff00">I've got cargo.</font>

583
00:49:04.336 --> 00:49:07.001
<font color="#ffff00">A thousand kilos
of dinosaur to Palermo.</font>

584
00:49:07.085 --> 00:49:08.586
<font color="#ffff00">I give you two thousand.</font>

585
00:49:09.317 --> 00:49:11.593
<font color="#ffff00">Two thousand? How much is there?</font>

586
00:49:21.497 --> 00:49:22.784
<font color="#ffff00">You lost?</font>

587
00:49:23.532 --> 00:49:24.840
<font color="#ffff00">You're American.</font>

588
00:49:26.323 --> 00:49:27.524
<font color="#ffff00">That makes us friends?</font>

589
00:49:27.931 --> 00:49:29.820
<font color="#ffff00">Listen, I just got here and--</font>

590
00:49:29.910 --> 00:49:32.498
<font color="#ffff00">No, that was not an invitation. Here.</font>

591
00:49:34.689 --> 00:49:37.067
<font color="#ffff00">A souvenir. Go back to the hotel.</font>

592
00:49:37.151 --> 00:49:39.280
<font color="#ffff00">You know, throw some bath salts
in the bath.</font>

593
00:49:39.364 --> 00:49:41.638
<font color="#ffff00">This place is not your vibe.</font>

594
00:49:42.125 --> 00:49:43.367
<font color="#ffff00">Wait.</font>

595
00:49:43.913 --> 00:49:45.620
<font color="#ffff00">-Look...
-Claire.</font>

596
00:49:46.550 --> 00:49:49.124
<font color="#ffff00">Claire, I know this must feel exotic,</font>

597
00:49:49.215 --> 00:49:53.084
<font color="#ffff00">but if you mess with the wrong person
down here you disappear.</font>

598
00:49:53.168 --> 00:49:54.633
<font color="#ffff00">You feel me?</font>

599
00:49:54.717 --> 00:49:56.194
<font color="#ffff00">Good luck, okay?</font>

600
00:49:56.278 --> 00:49:57.267
<font color="#ffff00">Wait.</font>

601
00:49:59.962 --> 00:50:01.353
<font color="#ffff00">-Wait.
-What is this?</font>

602
00:50:01.444 --> 00:50:03.483
<font color="#ffff00">-I need your help.
-I don't know you.</font>

603
00:50:03.567 --> 00:50:05.699
<font color="#ffff00">-I'm looking for someone.
-Don't do that.</font>

604
00:50:05.783 --> 00:50:07.845
<font color="#ffff00">She is all alone. Please.</font>

605
00:50:13.520 --> 00:50:15.530
<font color="#ffff00">-Is that your daughter?
-Yes.</font>

606
00:50:18.729 --> 00:50:20.087
<font color="#ffff00">Sorry, I can't get involved.</font>

607
00:50:39.934 --> 00:50:42.289
<font color="#ffff00">-I think I got him.
-Target on the move.</font>

608
00:50:42.877 --> 00:50:44.683
<font color="#ffff00">That's our undercover agent with him.</font>

609
00:50:45.333 --> 00:50:47.759
<font color="#ffff00">Claire, he's headed underground.
You see him?</font>

610
00:50:48.019 --> 00:50:49.348
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I've got him.</font>

611
00:50:50.905 --> 00:50:51.866
<font color="#ffff00">All right, let's go.</font>

612
00:50:57.913 --> 00:50:58.827
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, how you've been?</font>

613
00:50:59.340 --> 00:51:01.091
<font color="#ffff00"><i>All units stay at bullseye position.</i></font>

614
00:51:02.933 --> 00:51:06.735
<font color="#ffff00"><i>This is Bravo 1. Primary target inside.
No sign of the girl.</i></font>

615
00:51:19.262 --> 00:51:22.339
<font color="#ffff00">My people say the Raptor arrived
in good condition.</font>

616
00:51:22.993 --> 00:51:24.833
<font color="#ffff00">You boys didn't cuck this up.</font>

617
00:51:25.428 --> 00:51:26.716
<font color="#ffff00">Call me amazed.</font>

618
00:51:27.349 --> 00:51:30.054
<font color="#ffff00">I do have another job for you.
Short, hot money's double.</font>

619
00:51:30.528 --> 00:51:31.542
<font color="#ffff00">What's the cargo?</font>

620
00:51:34.058 --> 00:51:36.911
<font color="#ffff00">Atrociraptors, thoroughbreds.</font>

621
00:51:37.685 --> 00:51:38.784
<font color="#ffff00">Trained to kill.</font>

622
00:51:39.044 --> 00:51:39.915
<font color="#ffff00">Kill who?</font>

623
00:51:39.999 --> 00:51:41.473
<font color="#ffff00">Whoever they're told.</font>

624
00:51:41.557 --> 00:51:44.920
<font color="#ffff00">Laser marks the target, they attach
the scent, don't stop till it's dead.</font>

625
00:51:45.004 --> 00:51:45.877
<font color="#ffff00">Inescapable.</font>

626
00:51:46.355 --> 00:51:48.333
<font color="#ffff00">Those idiots making hybrids
had it all wrong.</font>

627
00:51:48.975 --> 00:51:52.084
<font color="#ffff00">You can't engineer loyalty,
you have to nurture it.</font>

628
00:51:52.936 --> 00:51:54.916
<font color="#ffff00">Fifty thousand to fly them to Riyadh.</font>

629
00:51:55.000 --> 00:51:56.706
<font color="#ffff00">"In" or "out"?</font>

630
00:51:57.754 --> 00:51:58.655
<font color="#ffff00">She's not here.</font>

631
00:52:03.602 --> 00:52:04.765
<font color="#ffff00">Where are we going?</font>

632
00:52:05.559 --> 00:52:06.687
<font color="#ffff00">Almost there.</font>

633
00:52:12.685 --> 00:52:14.030
<font color="#ffff00"><i>That's the draft. Let's go!</i></font>

634
00:52:14.428 --> 00:52:15.719
<font color="#ffff00">Everyone's down!</font>

635
00:52:16.481 --> 00:52:18.170
<font color="#ffff00">-Hands in the air!
-Drop your guns!</font>

636
00:52:18.254 --> 00:52:20.310
<font color="#ffff00">Delacourt, on the floor, now!</font>

637
00:52:20.394 --> 00:52:21.611
<font color="#ffff00">Get on the ground!</font>

638
00:52:21.695 --> 00:52:23.007
<font color="#ffff00">Delacourt, stay with!</font>

639
00:52:23.091 --> 00:52:24.205
<font color="#ffff00">Shit.</font>

640
00:52:25.832 --> 00:52:27.319
<font color="#ffff00">Get that truck out of here!</font>

641
00:52:27.811 --> 00:52:28.938
<font color="#ffff00">Santos, stay still!</font>

642
00:52:35.981 --> 00:52:37.418
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We've lost Delacourt.</i></font>

643
00:52:49.669 --> 00:52:52.398
<font color="#ffff00">This is Bravo 1.
The truck approaching the underpass.</font>

644
00:52:54.440 --> 00:52:55.314
<font color="#ffff00">Go.</font>

645
00:54:23.667 --> 00:54:26.235
<font color="#ffff00">The girl. Where is she?
Where did they take her?</font>

646
00:54:26.319 --> 00:54:28.360
<font color="#ffff00">-Where is she?
-I don't know!</font>

647
00:54:28.444 --> 00:54:31.829
<font color="#ffff00">We handed her off to Santos.
I don't know where they took her after.</font>

648
00:54:45.365 --> 00:54:47.851
<font color="#ffff00">Claire, It's Santos, the one in white.</font>

649
00:54:47.935 --> 00:54:48.919
<font color="#ffff00">I'll find her.</font>

650
00:54:55.951 --> 00:54:56.812
<font color="#ffff00">Hold it.</font>

651
00:54:57.487 --> 00:54:59.710
<font color="#ffff00">-Let them out.
-What?</font>

652
00:55:00.164 --> 00:55:01.205
<font color="#ffff00">You heard me.</font>

653
00:55:27.565 --> 00:55:28.493
<font color="#ffff00">Damn.</font>

654
00:55:30.721 --> 00:55:31.597
<font color="#ffff00">Shit.</font>

655
00:55:45.756 --> 00:55:47.186
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Claire, do you have her?</i></font>

656
00:56:01.266 --> 00:56:02.340
<font color="#ffff00">We had some trouble.</font>

657
00:56:02.424 --> 00:56:03.271
<font color="#ffff00">What kind?</font>

658
00:56:03.355 --> 00:56:06.503
<font color="#ffff00"><i>The parents, Grady and Dearing.
They're here.</i></font>

659
00:56:10.921 --> 00:56:12.333
<font color="#ffff00">Can you take care of it?</font>

660
00:56:12.417 --> 00:56:13.357
<font color="#ffff00">Not for free.</font>

661
00:56:14.922 --> 00:56:15.935
<font color="#ffff00">Well, do it.</font>

662
00:56:30.193 --> 00:56:31.560
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, okay. Listen.</font>

663
00:56:46.878 --> 00:56:48.778
<font color="#ffff00">You don't use it on people.</font>

664
00:56:48.869 --> 00:56:50.421
<font color="#ffff00">Where's my daughter?</font>

665
00:56:50.521 --> 00:56:52.010
<font color="#ffff00">She wasn't yours to begin with.</font>

666
00:56:54.501 --> 00:56:55.962
<font color="#ffff00">Tell me.</font>

667
00:56:57.698 --> 00:57:00.869
<font color="#ffff00">Biosyn. They're taking her to Biosyn.</font>

668
00:57:07.816 --> 00:57:10.298
<font color="#ffff00">You missed her. She's gone.</font>

669
00:58:03.023 --> 00:58:04.610
<font color="#ffff00">Take my hand. Come on!</font>

670
00:58:35.591 --> 00:58:36.479
<font color="#ffff00">Hold on tight.</font>

671
00:58:37.060 --> 00:58:37.988
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

672
00:58:49.081 --> 00:58:51.242
<font color="#ffff00">Do you remember
how we used to get Raptors in the truck?</font>

673
00:58:51.337 --> 00:58:52.491
<font color="#ffff00">-Yeah.
-Yeah.</font>

674
00:58:54.415 --> 00:58:55.652
<font color="#ffff00">-You're up.
-No.</font>

675
00:58:57.571 --> 00:58:59.315
<font color="#ffff00">The last minute dive roll.</font>

676
00:58:59.399 --> 00:59:00.319
<font color="#ffff00">I don't dive roll.</font>

677
00:59:00.403 --> 00:59:01.289
<font color="#ffff00">You'll be fine.</font>

678
00:59:01.997 --> 00:59:03.584
<font color="#ffff00">I never got the timing right.</font>

679
00:59:05.419 --> 00:59:07.687
<font color="#ffff00">-Now?
-Any minute. Any minute now.</font>

680
00:59:08.421 --> 00:59:09.278
<font color="#ffff00">Now?</font>

681
00:59:09.765 --> 00:59:10.605
<font color="#ffff00">No.</font>

682
00:59:12.387 --> 00:59:13.242
<font color="#ffff00">Now!</font>

683
00:59:20.842 --> 00:59:22.247
<font color="#ffff00">Freeze!</font>

684
00:59:29.113 --> 00:59:31.511
<font color="#ffff00">I'll fly us outta here.
Tell me where you wanna be dropped.</font>

685
00:59:31.969 --> 00:59:33.573
<font color="#ffff00">You ever flown to Biosyn?</font>

686
00:59:34.998 --> 00:59:36.954
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Owen, they took her to Biosyn.</i></font>

687
00:59:37.038 --> 00:59:40.022
<font color="#ffff00"><i>There's an airfield on the north side
of the island.</i></font>

688
00:59:40.106 --> 00:59:42.140
<font color="#ffff00">You're under arrest. Stay where you are.</font>

689
01:00:09.485 --> 01:00:10.399
<font color="#ffff00">Right!</font>

690
01:00:15.281 --> 01:00:16.286
<font color="#ffff00">Get down!</font>

691
01:01:55.039 --> 01:01:57.268
<font color="#ffff00">We made a lot of enemies. We gotta go.</font>

692
01:01:57.352 --> 01:01:58.556
<font color="#ffff00">He'll be here.</font>

693
01:02:02.759 --> 01:02:04.278
<font color="#ffff00">Out of time. Out of time.</font>

694
01:02:07.133 --> 01:02:08.267
<font color="#ffff00">There he is.</font>

695
01:02:10.492 --> 01:02:12.282
<font color="#ffff00">-Pull over.
-That's not how planes work.</font>

696
01:02:12.366 --> 01:02:13.695
<font color="#ffff00">sub.T</font>

697
01:02:18.912 --> 01:02:20.291
<font color="#ffff00">Open the back.</font>

698
01:02:39.480 --> 01:02:40.635
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>

699
01:02:45.379 --> 01:02:47.108
<font color="#ffff00">Hold on tight!</font>

700
01:03:17.520 --> 01:03:18.788
<font color="#ffff00">Still got it.</font>

701
01:03:37.844 --> 01:03:39.381
<font color="#ffff00">Kayla Watts.</font>

702
01:03:40.207 --> 01:03:41.291
<font color="#ffff00">You're welcome.</font>

703
01:03:42.315 --> 01:03:44.014
<font color="#ffff00">You look like you fly for Biosyn.</font>

704
01:03:44.142 --> 01:03:47.289
<font color="#ffff00">I'm gonna take that the way you meant it
and not the way it sounded.</font>

705
01:03:47.373 --> 01:03:50.563
<font color="#ffff00">I fly for whoever got a bag,
but we'll call this one a favor.</font>

706
01:03:50.647 --> 01:03:52.629
<font color="#ffff00">Those don't work. They broke.</font>

707
01:03:54.319 --> 01:03:57.065
<font color="#ffff00">I'll take y'all to Biosyn
but I can't promise it won't be dangerous.</font>

708
01:03:57.845 --> 01:04:00.565
<font color="#ffff00">You're willing to risk your life
for people you've never met?</font>

709
01:04:01.700 --> 01:04:04.305
<font color="#ffff00">You wanna ask questions or you wanna ride?</font>

710
01:04:08.286 --> 01:04:09.527
<font color="#ffff00">We'll take the ride.</font>

711
01:04:16.862 --> 01:04:21.019
<font color="#ffff00">So, this is our Habitat Development Lab.
A lot of exciting discoveries as of late.</font>

712
01:04:21.607 --> 01:04:24.008
<font color="#ffff00">We've brought back numerous species
in their purest form.</font>

713
01:04:24.092 --> 01:04:26.674
<font color="#ffff00">And I mean complete untouched genomes.</font>

714
01:04:26.758 --> 01:04:28.328
<font color="#ffff00">Like Moros intrepidus.</font>

715
01:04:28.412 --> 01:04:29.553
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

716
01:04:32.035 --> 01:04:32.895
<font color="#ffff00">Wow.</font>

717
01:04:35.857 --> 01:04:39.817
<font color="#ffff00">What about splicing DNA,
you know, creating new species?</font>

718
01:04:39.901 --> 01:04:42.696
<font color="#ffff00">No, Dr. Sattler, we don't do that here.</font>

719
01:04:42.780 --> 01:04:44.312
<font color="#ffff00">We like to think we're more evolved.</font>

720
01:04:48.958 --> 01:04:51.638
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, looks like we still have some
time left before your ride.</font>

721
01:04:52.609 --> 01:04:54.947
<font color="#ffff00">Would you guys like
to tour the facilities yourselves?</font>

722
01:04:56.435 --> 01:04:59.068
<font color="#ffff00">I mean, we could?</font>

723
01:04:59.152 --> 01:04:59.996
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, why not.</font>

724
01:05:00.080 --> 01:05:03.366
<font color="#ffff00">Great, I'll meet you guys
at the Hyperloop Station 3</font>

725
01:05:03.450 --> 01:05:05.309
<font color="#ffff00">in about 30 minutes.</font>

726
01:05:05.394 --> 01:05:07.897
<font color="#ffff00">Elevators are down this hall. Not those.</font>

727
01:05:08.563 --> 01:05:10.542
<font color="#ffff00">Those lead you down to the sub-levels.</font>

728
01:05:10.633 --> 01:05:13.063
<font color="#ffff00">You need special clearance
to get down there.</font>

729
01:05:13.147 --> 01:05:14.042
<font color="#ffff00">Thirty minutes.</font>

730
01:05:23.581 --> 01:05:25.449
<font color="#ffff00">Here. Take this.</font>

731
01:05:27.784 --> 01:05:29.433
<font color="#ffff00">-You're ready?
-Yep.</font>

732
01:05:39.483 --> 01:05:41.683
<font color="#ffff00">I'm really sorry
that it had to happen this way.</font>

733
01:05:42.671 --> 01:05:44.412
<font color="#ffff00">Yep, that's what kidnappers say.</font>

734
01:05:45.817 --> 01:05:48.010
<font color="#ffff00">Claire should never have hidden you away.</font>

735
01:05:48.094 --> 01:05:50.490
<font color="#ffff00">You're way too important, Maisie.</font>

736
01:05:55.410 --> 01:05:56.404
<font color="#ffff00">You took her too?</font>

737
01:05:57.409 --> 01:05:58.303
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

738
01:05:59.338 --> 01:06:01.780
<font color="#ffff00">We needed her to help us understand you.</font>

739
01:06:06.803 --> 01:06:08.150
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, Beta.</font>

740
01:06:10.205 --> 01:06:11.488
<font color="#ffff00">You okay?</font>

741
01:06:11.572 --> 01:06:14.307
<font color="#ffff00">Did you say Beta? Is that her name?</font>

742
01:06:15.194 --> 01:06:16.583
<font color="#ffff00">I gave it to her.</font>

743
01:06:17.196 --> 01:06:18.435
<font color="#ffff00">Beta's pretty special.</font>

744
01:06:18.963 --> 01:06:21.771
<font color="#ffff00">When we made Blue,
we used Monitor lizard DNA</font>

745
01:06:21.869 --> 01:06:23.538
<font color="#ffff00">to fill in the gaps in her genome.</font>

746
01:06:24.467 --> 01:06:27.212
<font color="#ffff00">Monitor lizards can reproduce
without a mate.</font>

747
01:06:27.593 --> 01:06:31.431
<font color="#ffff00">So, Beta and Blue
are genetically identical.</font>

748
01:06:31.535 --> 01:06:33.668
<font color="#ffff00">and that's what they have
in common with you and--</font>

749
01:06:33.769 --> 01:06:34.670
<font color="#ffff00">Charlotte.</font>

750
01:06:37.786 --> 01:06:39.444
<font color="#ffff00">What do you know about Charlotte?</font>

751
01:06:39.905 --> 01:06:41.065
<font color="#ffff00">She died.</font>

752
01:06:42.207 --> 01:06:43.535
<font color="#ffff00">A long time ago.</font>

753
01:06:44.549 --> 01:06:46.207
<font color="#ffff00">It broke my grandpa's heart.</font>

754
01:06:48.189 --> 01:06:49.911
<font color="#ffff00">So, he made me.</font>

755
01:06:51.350 --> 01:06:53.312
<font color="#ffff00">No, Maisie, actually he didn't.</font>

756
01:06:55.889 --> 01:06:57.632
<font color="#ffff00">Charlotte made you.</font>

757
01:07:00.657 --> 01:07:04.225
<font color="#ffff00"><i>I'm so excited that everyone see
what we've been doing here.</i></font>

758
01:07:04.309 --> 01:07:08.497
<font color="#ffff00"><i>There's new technology being made,
new science, like every day almost.</i></font>

759
01:07:09.261 --> 01:07:13.023
<font color="#ffff00"><i>And it's great to be
in the center of that.</i></font>

760
01:07:13.990 --> 01:07:19.352
<font color="#ffff00">Charlotte lived on Site B
with all of us till the storm.</font>

761
01:07:20.729 --> 01:07:22.284
<font color="#ffff00">She'd loved dinosaurs.</font>

762
01:07:22.492 --> 01:07:23.902
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Charlotte, be careful.</i></font>

763
01:07:23.986 --> 01:07:24.840
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Yeah, I will.</i></font>

764
01:07:24.924 --> 01:07:26.669
<font color="#ffff00">She grew up around scientists.</font>

765
01:07:27.923 --> 01:07:29.164
<font color="#ffff00">And eventually...</font>

766
01:07:30.973 --> 01:07:32.511
<font color="#ffff00">she became one herself.</font>

767
01:07:32.595 --> 01:07:34.681
<font color="#ffff00"><i>A butterfly flew into my office
this morning.</i></font>

768
01:07:35.355 --> 01:07:38.698
<font color="#ffff00"><i>They say tiny things have huge impacts,
and I agree, wholeheartedly.</i></font>

769
01:07:39.529 --> 01:07:40.885
<font color="#ffff00">She was brilliant.</font>

770
01:07:43.068 --> 01:07:44.531
<font color="#ffff00">In ways that I'll never be.</font>

771
01:07:44.963 --> 01:07:48.533
<font color="#ffff00"><i>In a metaphysics of identity,
can a replica truly be the original?</i></font>

772
01:07:49.186 --> 01:07:50.344
<font color="#ffff00"><i>And if it's possible,</i></font>

773
01:07:51.305 --> 01:07:52.634
<font color="#ffff00"><i>what makes it so?</i></font>

774
01:07:57.621 --> 01:07:59.183
<font color="#ffff00"><i>I've lost my pen.</i></font>

775
01:08:02.482 --> 01:08:04.452
<font color="#ffff00">-Is that me?
-Yeah.</font>

776
01:08:06.628 --> 01:08:09.903
<font color="#ffff00">Just like Blue Charlotte was able
to have a child all by herself.</font>

777
01:08:11.211 --> 01:08:14.641
<font color="#ffff00">She created you with her own DNA.</font>

778
01:08:15.939 --> 01:08:17.057
<font color="#ffff00">So, I do have a mother.</font>

779
01:08:18.112 --> 01:08:20.661
<font color="#ffff00">Your grandfather didn't want anyone
to know the truth.</font>

780
01:08:21.406 --> 01:08:22.679
<font color="#ffff00">He was protecting her.</font>

781
01:08:23.346 --> 01:08:24.347
<font color="#ffff00">And you.</font>

782
01:08:25.324 --> 01:08:26.395
<font color="#ffff00">Are we the same?</font>

783
01:08:28.506 --> 01:08:29.521
<font color="#ffff00">You were.</font>

784
01:08:30.621 --> 01:08:34.294
<font color="#ffff00">When you were a baby Charlotte started
to show symptoms of a genetic disorder.</font>

785
01:08:34.929 --> 01:08:36.232
<font color="#ffff00">That's how she died.</font>

786
01:08:36.887 --> 01:08:39.100
<font color="#ffff00">She didn't know she had it
until after you were born.</font>

787
01:08:40.667 --> 01:08:42.430
<font color="#ffff00">-Do I have it too?
-No.</font>

788
01:08:43.678 --> 01:08:45.596
<font color="#ffff00">She changed your DNA.</font>

789
01:08:46.377 --> 01:08:50.605
<font color="#ffff00">She altered every cell in your body
to eradicate this disease.</font>

790
01:08:51.135 --> 01:08:54.074
<font color="#ffff00">No one on Earth has ever known
how to do that.</font>

791
01:08:54.562 --> 01:08:55.612
<font color="#ffff00">She fixed me.</font>

792
01:08:56.219 --> 01:08:59.056
<font color="#ffff00">Charlotte's discovery
is a part of you now.</font>

793
01:09:00.878 --> 01:09:03.705
<font color="#ffff00">Your DNA could change the world.</font>

794
01:09:04.429 --> 01:09:06.840
<font color="#ffff00">And I have to know how she did it.</font>

795
01:09:06.924 --> 01:09:08.717
<font color="#ffff00">But I just can't replicate her work.</font>

796
01:09:08.801 --> 01:09:10.518
<font color="#ffff00">If I could just study you</font>

797
01:09:10.602 --> 01:09:13.858
<font color="#ffff00">and Beta whose DNA
was never changed I could...</font>

798
01:09:16.293 --> 01:09:18.976
<font color="#ffff00">fix a terrible mistake that I've made.</font>

799
01:09:19.717 --> 01:09:21.031
<font color="#ffff00">What's kind of mistake?</font>

800
01:09:29.418 --> 01:09:31.635
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Sub-level 6. Restricted.</i></font>

801
01:09:36.463 --> 01:09:37.925
<font color="#ffff00">Thanks for coming.</font>

802
01:09:42.541 --> 01:09:44.411
<font color="#ffff00">Which lab did Malcolm say?</font>

803
01:09:44.510 --> 01:09:45.409
<font color="#ffff00">L4.</font>

804
01:09:50.517 --> 01:09:51.538
<font color="#ffff00">This is it.</font>

805
01:10:10.944 --> 01:10:14.679
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, get in, get the sample, and get out.</font>

806
01:10:14.762 --> 01:10:18.052
<font color="#ffff00">And move slow. They could swarm
at even the slightest disturbance.</font>

807
01:10:43.476 --> 01:10:44.901
<font color="#ffff00">Orthoptera.</font>

808
01:10:46.743 --> 01:10:48.311
<font color="#ffff00">Who weeks.</font>

809
01:10:51.968 --> 01:10:54.696
<font color="#ffff00">Fully mature. This one.</font>

810
01:10:57.168 --> 01:10:59.390
<font color="#ffff00">Ready? Easy.</font>

811
01:11:03.442 --> 01:11:05.745
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, go.</font>

812
01:11:07.724 --> 01:11:08.805
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

813
01:11:09.753 --> 01:11:11.001
<font color="#ffff00">Go get it.</font>

814
01:11:13.270 --> 01:11:14.430
<font color="#ffff00">I that necessary?</font>

815
01:11:15.144 --> 01:11:16.800
<font color="#ffff00">What did you think was gonna happen?</font>

816
01:11:16.884 --> 01:11:20.278
<font color="#ffff00">I have to take a sample.
We need concrete evidence. This is it.</font>

817
01:11:20.362 --> 01:11:22.338
<font color="#ffff00">Alan, you said there was no time.</font>

818
01:11:22.422 --> 01:11:23.828
<font color="#ffff00">Can you get it?</font>

819
01:11:23.912 --> 01:11:25.280
<font color="#ffff00">Of course I can get it.</font>

820
01:11:26.698 --> 01:11:27.872
<font color="#ffff00">Easy.</font>

821
01:11:30.193 --> 01:11:31.334
<font color="#ffff00">Watch its legs.</font>

822
01:11:35.047 --> 01:11:36.005
<font color="#ffff00">Here we go.</font>

823
01:11:37.986 --> 01:11:39.507
<font color="#ffff00">They're still signaling between them.</font>

824
01:11:39.591 --> 01:11:41.396
<font color="#ffff00">-This is not good, Ellen.
-Almost got it.</font>

825
01:11:44.435 --> 01:11:48.187
<font color="#ffff00">How does she remain an asset, Henry,
if you're incriminating both of us</font>

826
01:11:48.271 --> 01:11:50.771
<font color="#ffff00">by showing her classified things
on the computer?</font>

827
01:11:50.855 --> 01:11:53.878
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Charlotte Lockwood believed the methods
we used at Jurassic Park </i></font>

828
01:11:53.971 --> 01:11:55.362
<font color="#ffff00"><i>could cure diseases.</i></font>

829
01:11:55.870 --> 01:11:56.946
<font color="#ffff00"><i>She was right.</i></font>

830
01:11:57.431 --> 01:12:00.856
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Having filled the gaps in Maisie's genome
with altered DNA,</i></font>

831
01:12:00.940 --> 01:12:05.067
<font color="#ffff00"><i>she used a pathogen to deliver
the repaired sequence to every cell.</i></font>

832
01:12:05.728 --> 01:12:09.759
<font color="#ffff00"><i>If I can re-purpose what she did,
I could change the locusts DNA,</i></font>

833
01:12:09.843 --> 01:12:12.379
<font color="#ffff00"><i>eradicating them in a single generation.</i></font>

834
01:12:12.473 --> 01:12:15.549
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Maisie and the baby Raptor
will provide the missing data.</i></font>

835
01:12:23.313 --> 01:12:25.073
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, you wanna get out of that?</font>

836
01:12:28.967 --> 01:12:30.095
<font color="#ffff00">What the..?</font>

837
01:12:31.788 --> 01:12:32.722
<font color="#ffff00">Got it.</font>

838
01:12:57.769 --> 01:12:58.944
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie!</font>

839
01:13:11.163 --> 01:13:14.183
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Asset containment breach.
Please remain in your sessions.</i></font>

840
01:13:16.303 --> 01:13:18.950
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Asset containment breach.
Please remain in your sessions.</i></font>

841
01:13:23.818 --> 01:13:25.019
<font color="#ffff00">Where's the key?</font>

842
01:13:43.468 --> 01:13:44.409
<font color="#ffff00">You okay?</font>

843
01:13:45.164 --> 01:13:47.299
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, you?</font>

844
01:13:48.153 --> 01:13:49.150
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

845
01:13:58.879 --> 01:14:02.801
<font color="#ffff00">You are Dr. Ellie Sattler and Alan Grant.</font>

846
01:14:03.474 --> 01:14:04.983
<font color="#ffff00">You were at Jurassic Park.</font>

847
01:14:06.217 --> 01:14:08.055
<font color="#ffff00">What are you doing here?</font>

848
01:14:10.394 --> 01:14:11.702
<font color="#ffff00">What are you doing here?</font>

849
01:14:14.063 --> 01:14:15.720
<font color="#ffff00">My name is Maisie Lockwood.</font>

850
01:14:17.038 --> 01:14:19.238
<font color="#ffff00">My grandpa knew John Hammond.</font>

851
01:14:25.778 --> 01:14:26.812
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

852
01:14:27.180 --> 01:14:28.857
<font color="#ffff00">We don't--</font>

853
01:14:29.765 --> 01:14:31.105
<font color="#ffff00">We don't work for Biosyn.</font>

854
01:14:31.587 --> 01:14:32.810
<font color="#ffff00">I can tell.</font>

855
01:14:33.063 --> 01:14:35.018
<font color="#ffff00">-We gotta get out of here.
-Yeah, we should go.</font>

856
01:14:51.216 --> 01:14:53.911
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, in and out.
We find your girl and go.</font>

857
01:14:55.205 --> 01:14:58.378
<font color="#ffff00">Tower, this N141, request to land
for freight delivery, over.</font>

858
01:14:58.664 --> 01:14:59.850
<font color="#ffff00">N141, negative,</font>

859
01:14:59.934 --> 01:15:03.256
<font color="#ffff00">we've been advised you're carrying
unauthorized passengers, over.</font>

860
01:15:03.340 --> 01:15:06.620
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Copy that, Tower, be advised,
shipment is perishable.</i></font>

861
01:15:06.704 --> 01:15:09.021
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We need immediate clearance.
It's an emergency, over.</i></font>

862
01:15:09.105 --> 01:15:10.456
<font color="#ffff00">But we said "no."</font>

863
01:15:11.311 --> 01:15:13.519
<font color="#ffff00">Negative, return to point of origin.</font>

864
01:15:13.603 --> 01:15:16.208
<font color="#ffff00">You seem to be breaking up.
Are you hearing me on your side?</font>

865
01:15:18.714 --> 01:15:20.710
<font color="#ffff00">Nice try, Kayla. They will down your bird.</font>

866
01:15:21.517 --> 01:15:24.136
<font color="#ffff00">Who is this? Is this Denise?</font>

867
01:15:24.220 --> 01:15:26.348
<font color="#ffff00"><i>You do not want me
to start spilling secrets, Denise.</i></font>

868
01:15:26.432 --> 01:15:28.054
<font color="#ffff00"><i>You remember Dubrovnik?</i></font>

869
01:15:30.444 --> 01:15:34.108
<font color="#ffff00">It's a different Denise. In accounts.</font>

870
01:15:41.825 --> 01:15:43.062
<font color="#ffff00">Talked to Santos.</font>

871
01:15:43.749 --> 01:15:45.111
<font color="#ffff00">It's the girl's parents.</font>

872
01:15:48.006 --> 01:15:49.883
<font color="#ffff00">Shut off the ADS.</font>

873
01:15:50.250 --> 01:15:51.263
<font color="#ffff00">You sure?</font>

874
01:16:00.506 --> 01:16:01.854
<font color="#ffff00">What's that?</font>

875
01:16:03.036 --> 01:16:05.431
<font color="#ffff00">That's the Aerial Deterrent System.</font>

876
01:16:05.632 --> 01:16:07.027
<font color="#ffff00">Keeps the airborne life away.</font>

877
01:16:07.110 --> 01:16:08.151
<font color="#ffff00">Why is it blinking?</font>

878
01:16:08.235 --> 01:16:10.354
<font color="#ffff00">Because deadass Denise
in the Tower just turned it off.</font>

879
01:16:10.438 --> 01:16:12.221
<font color="#ffff00">We gotta get out
of this airspace right now.</font>

880
01:16:16.938 --> 01:16:18.468
<font color="#ffff00">That's another plane, right?</font>

881
01:16:18.552 --> 01:16:19.733
<font color="#ffff00">Not exactly.</font>

882
01:16:23.436 --> 01:16:25.566
<font color="#ffff00">-Is that a..?
-Quetzalcoatlus.</font>

883
01:16:26.120 --> 01:16:27.909
<font color="#ffff00">Late Cretaceous, should've stayed there.</font>

884
01:16:34.571 --> 01:16:36.656
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, okay.</font>

885
01:16:37.337 --> 01:16:38.959
<font color="#ffff00">It's cool. We're good. It's gone.</font>

886
01:16:56.154 --> 01:16:58.099
<font color="#ffff00">This plane in going down.</font>

887
01:16:58.183 --> 01:17:00.828
<font color="#ffff00">If you're gonna eject
you need to do it now.</font>

888
01:17:00.912 --> 01:17:02.770
<font color="#ffff00">I only got one chair, she's in it.</font>

889
01:17:02.858 --> 01:17:06.005
<font color="#ffff00">-You don't have parachutes?
-I wasn't expecting company.</font>

890
01:17:13.807 --> 01:17:16.543
<font color="#ffff00">Claire, we gotta get you off this plane.</font>

891
01:17:16.627 --> 01:17:17.481
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

892
01:17:17.565 --> 01:17:19.622
<font color="#ffff00">The parachute is gonna open automatically.</font>

893
01:17:19.706 --> 01:17:22.465
<font color="#ffff00">If it doesn't you pull this lever.
Do you understand me?</font>

894
01:17:22.549 --> 01:17:24.954
<font color="#ffff00">Claire! If it doesn't open automatically</font>

895
01:17:25.038 --> 01:17:27.104
<font color="#ffff00">you gotta pull this lever here
behind you, okay?</font>

896
01:17:27.188 --> 01:17:28.533
<font color="#ffff00">Ten thousand feet!</font>

897
01:17:28.617 --> 01:17:30.716
<font color="#ffff00">Hey! You're the one
who's gotta go get to her.</font>

898
01:17:30.800 --> 01:17:32.882
<font color="#ffff00">You're her mom. You're her only shot.</font>

899
01:17:35.867 --> 01:17:37.129
<font color="#ffff00">I'll see you again.</font>

900
01:17:38.924 --> 01:17:40.062
<font color="#ffff00">I love you.</font>

901
01:18:29.825 --> 01:18:30.870
<font color="#ffff00">What's the plan?</font>

902
01:18:30.954 --> 01:18:33.672
<font color="#ffff00">Whatever happens - that's the plan.</font>

903
01:18:48.219 --> 01:18:49.127
<font color="#ffff00">Three.</font>

904
01:18:50.331 --> 01:18:51.895
<font color="#ffff00">Alan, we need the code.</font>

905
01:18:51.979 --> 01:18:53.147
<font color="#ffff00">Let's try this thing.</font>

906
01:18:53.374 --> 01:18:54.373
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

907
01:18:54.934 --> 01:18:56.281
<font color="#ffff00">Get down.</font>

908
01:19:01.833 --> 01:19:03.541
<font color="#ffff00">Thank God, it's you.</font>

909
01:19:04.236 --> 01:19:06.036
<font color="#ffff00">This place is such a maze.</font>

910
01:19:06.121 --> 01:19:08.333
<font color="#ffff00">We were so confused.
I thought we were straight up lost</font>

911
01:19:08.417 --> 01:19:10.698
<font color="#ffff00">Then you said Station 3.
And I was like, we thought--</font>

912
01:19:10.782 --> 01:19:11.977
<font color="#ffff00">Do you have the sample?</font>

913
01:19:12.512 --> 01:19:13.916
<font color="#ffff00">-What?
-What are you talking about?</font>

914
01:19:14.000 --> 01:19:15.608
<font color="#ffff00">The DNA sample, do you have it?</font>

915
01:19:16.269 --> 01:19:18.308
<font color="#ffff00">Biosyn's responsible
for the locusts epidemic.</font>

916
01:19:18.392 --> 01:19:19.399
<font color="#ffff00">Dodgson's covering it up.</font>

917
01:19:19.483 --> 01:19:21.522
<font color="#ffff00">You were right. I'm here to help you.</font>

918
01:19:22.410 --> 01:19:23.493
<font color="#ffff00">Do you have it?</font>

919
01:19:25.892 --> 01:19:26.753
<font color="#ffff00">Good.</font>

920
01:19:27.243 --> 01:19:29.169
<font color="#ffff00">This pod will take you
straight to the airfield.</font>

921
01:19:29.253 --> 01:19:30.496
<font color="#ffff00">We have a plane ready to fly.</font>

922
01:19:30.580 --> 01:19:32.682
<font color="#ffff00">Ian told you about Hexapod Allies?</font>

923
01:19:32.766 --> 01:19:34.475
<font color="#ffff00">No, I told him.</font>

924
01:19:34.559 --> 01:19:35.422
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

925
01:19:36.489 --> 01:19:38.180
<font color="#ffff00">-Okay, guys, gotta go.
-Wait.</font>

926
01:19:43.230 --> 01:19:44.503
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie.</font>

927
01:19:47.579 --> 01:19:48.706
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie Lockwood.</font>

928
01:19:51.986 --> 01:19:52.856
<font color="#ffff00">Go.</font>

929
01:24:07.865 --> 01:24:09.420
<font color="#ffff00">That was my baby.</font>

930
01:24:18.001 --> 01:24:19.248
<font color="#ffff00">Where'd you learn to fly?</font>

931
01:24:20.596 --> 01:24:21.871
<font color="#ffff00">Air Force.</font>

932
01:24:22.059 --> 01:24:23.699
<font color="#ffff00">Legacy on my mama side.</font>

933
01:24:24.200 --> 01:24:25.326
<font color="#ffff00">I'm Navy.</font>

934
01:24:25.795 --> 01:24:27.610
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, so how'd you end up doing this?</font>

935
01:24:28.261 --> 01:24:30.410
<font color="#ffff00">I was a legit contract pilot for a grip,</font>

936
01:24:30.494 --> 01:24:33.007
<font color="#ffff00">but didn't exactly pay enough
to be out here sending money home,**</font>

937
01:24:33.091 --> 01:24:35.638
<font color="#ffff00">so I hit up a few contacts
for the more lucrative shady shit.</font>

938
01:24:37.767 --> 01:24:40.191
<font color="#ffff00">Honestly, I might be done
with this line of work.</font>

939
01:24:40.525 --> 01:24:41.926
<font color="#ffff00">Is that why you're helping us?</font>

940
01:24:45.198 --> 01:24:47.613
<font color="#ffff00">I was there when they handed
your girl off to Biosyn.</font>

941
01:24:49.274 --> 01:24:52.486
<font color="#ffff00">I could've said something, but I didn't.</font>

942
01:24:52.803 --> 01:24:54.234
<font color="#ffff00">And when I saw her picture...</font>

943
01:24:57.077 --> 01:24:59.773
<font color="#ffff00">It isn't enough to do nothing.</font>

944
01:25:04.284 --> 01:25:05.287
<font color="#ffff00">Thank you.</font>

945
01:25:52.286 --> 01:25:53.528
<font color="#ffff00">No.</font>

946
01:25:58.094 --> 01:25:58.977
<font color="#ffff00">Nope.</font>

947
01:26:23.361 --> 01:26:24.670
<font color="#ffff00">What an asshole.</font>

948
01:27:16.106 --> 01:27:16.997
<font color="#ffff00">You good?</font>

949
01:27:17.785 --> 01:27:19.356
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah. Yeah, yeah.</font>

950
01:27:19.440 --> 01:27:20.735
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not shook at all. Are you?</font>

951
01:27:21.362 --> 01:27:22.277
<font color="#ffff00">No. No.</font>

952
01:27:24.932 --> 01:27:27.281
<font color="#ffff00">Ejection seat beacon. We'll find her.</font>

953
01:27:27.395 --> 01:27:28.724
<font color="#ffff00">Okay. Okay.</font>

954
01:27:29.389 --> 01:27:30.989
<font color="#ffff00">You really love her, huh?</font>

955
01:27:32.725 --> 01:27:33.573
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

956
01:27:34.463 --> 01:27:35.454
<font color="#ffff00">I get it.</font>

957
01:27:36.956 --> 01:27:38.537
<font color="#ffff00">I like redheads too.</font>

958
01:27:39.967 --> 01:27:41.249
<font color="#ffff00">What? God.</font>

959
01:27:45.305 --> 01:27:47.912
<font color="#ffff00">-Who is that?
-That's Grant and Sattler.</font>

960
01:27:47.996 --> 01:27:50.212
<font color="#ffff00">-Is this live?
-Twelve minutes ago.</font>

961
01:27:50.296 --> 01:27:52.909
<font color="#ffff00">We were tracking the escaped asset.
My guys missed it.</font>

962
01:27:53.623 --> 01:27:55.391
<font color="#ffff00">They stole a DNA sample.</font>

963
01:27:55.845 --> 01:27:58.240
<font color="#ffff00">-How did they get in there?
-They used an access key.</font>

964
01:27:58.324 --> 01:27:59.603
<font color="#ffff00">Yankee white clearance.</font>

965
01:28:00.951 --> 01:28:04.393
<font color="#ffff00">One of our cameras saw Ian Malcolm
put something in Sattler's pocket.</font>

966
01:28:06.617 --> 01:28:08.501
<font color="#ffff00">All right. I wanna see him.</font>

967
01:28:08.586 --> 01:28:10.290
<font color="#ffff00">And get Ramsay up here too, will you?</font>

968
01:28:11.838 --> 01:28:12.792
<font color="#ffff00">Where are they now?</font>

969
01:28:12.876 --> 01:28:14.473
<font color="#ffff00">On the way to the airfield.</font>

970
01:28:14.557 --> 01:28:16.505
<font color="#ffff00">They caught a hyperloop right on schedule.</font>

971
01:28:22.683 --> 01:28:23.765
<font color="#ffff00">How are you?</font>

972
01:28:25.070 --> 01:28:26.291
<font color="#ffff00">You all right?</font>

973
01:28:27.695 --> 01:28:29.343
<font color="#ffff00">Not really, no.</font>

974
01:28:31.328 --> 01:28:32.188
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

975
01:28:33.096 --> 01:28:35.347
<font color="#ffff00">I knew your mom.</font>

976
01:28:39.525 --> 01:28:41.088
<font color="#ffff00">You did?</font>

977
01:28:43.013 --> 01:28:45.948
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, few years after Hammond died</font>

978
01:28:46.822 --> 01:28:49.407
<font color="#ffff00">she came to my university to lecture.</font>

979
01:28:51.107 --> 01:28:52.467
<font color="#ffff00">And we became good friends.</font>

980
01:28:53.075 --> 01:28:54.472
<font color="#ffff00">What was she like?</font>

981
01:28:54.989 --> 01:28:56.127
<font color="#ffff00">Brilliant.</font>

982
01:28:56.218 --> 01:28:58.114
<font color="#ffff00">Light-years ahead of everybody else.</font>

983
01:28:59.445 --> 01:29:00.934
<font color="#ffff00">And she had a consciousness.</font>

984
01:29:01.741 --> 01:29:04.259
<font color="#ffff00">When they were building theme parks</font>

985
01:29:04.376 --> 01:29:07.690
<font color="#ffff00">she was determined to prove
that genetic power could save lives.</font>

986
01:29:09.157 --> 01:29:11.662
<font color="#ffff00">-And I was her experiment?
-No.</font>

987
01:29:14.390 --> 01:29:16.358
<font color="#ffff00">She wanted a child more than anything.</font>

988
01:29:17.453 --> 01:29:20.045
<font color="#ffff00">But she wanted you to have
what she couldn't,</font>

989
01:29:21.569 --> 01:29:22.557
<font color="#ffff00">a full life.</font>

990
01:29:25.896 --> 01:29:27.615
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't know her long,</font>

991
01:29:28.780 --> 01:29:30.611
<font color="#ffff00">but I know she loved you very much.</font>

992
01:29:51.600 --> 01:29:52.605
<font color="#ffff00">What's happening?</font>

993
01:29:57.959 --> 01:29:59.780
<font color="#ffff00">This must be the old amber mines.</font>

994
01:30:01.406 --> 01:30:04.398
<font color="#ffff00">They must've made access doors
when they built these tunnels.</font>

995
01:30:29.836 --> 01:30:31.006
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

996
01:30:31.090 --> 01:30:32.678
<font color="#ffff00">I heard the alarm. Everything all right?</font>

997
01:30:32.763 --> 01:30:35.471
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, nothing we can't handle.</font>

998
01:30:35.555 --> 01:30:36.577
<font color="#ffff00">Listen...</font>

999
01:30:36.661 --> 01:30:37.498
<font color="#ffff00">You rang?</font>

1000
01:30:37.582 --> 01:30:39.739
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, good, Dr. Malcolm, you are</font>

1001
01:30:40.672 --> 01:30:41.687
<font color="#ffff00">fired.</font>

1002
01:30:42.459 --> 01:30:43.562
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

1003
01:30:43.646 --> 01:30:46.566
<font color="#ffff00">It was such a cushy gig.</font>

1004
01:30:46.650 --> 01:30:50.585
<font color="#ffff00">You can give your access key
to security if you still have it.</font>

1005
01:30:50.668 --> 01:30:53.534
<font color="#ffff00">One of the hyperloop pods
just shut down in the amber mines.</font>

1006
01:30:53.618 --> 01:30:54.488
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

1007
01:30:55.242 --> 01:30:57.580
<font color="#ffff00">Wow, this day.</font>

1008
01:30:58.099 --> 01:30:59.583
<font color="#ffff00">Which pod?</font>

1009
01:30:59.667 --> 01:31:00.625
<font color="#ffff00">Are there...</font>

1010
01:31:02.094 --> 01:31:03.585
<font color="#ffff00">dinosaurs in the mines?</font>

1011
01:31:03.669 --> 01:31:05.293
<font color="#ffff00">There are dinosaurs everywhere.</font>

1012
01:31:05.377 --> 01:31:07.596
<font color="#ffff00">Technically birds are dinosaurs,
genetically speaking.</font>

1013
01:31:07.680 --> 01:31:11.290
<font color="#ffff00">Lewis, Grant and Sattler are on this pod.
We need to send a security team out there.</font>

1014
01:31:11.374 --> 01:31:13.137
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, absolutely, Ramsay, thank you.</font>

1015
01:31:13.221 --> 01:31:14.912
<font color="#ffff00">Let's all just stay in our lanes though.</font>

1016
01:31:15.420 --> 01:31:17.598
<font color="#ffff00">We can take care of it.
Thank you, Doctor.</font>

1017
01:31:17.682 --> 01:31:20.209
<font color="#ffff00">That's it, huh? Nothing else to see here?</font>

1018
01:31:20.910 --> 01:31:24.100
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not sure I admire your tone right now.</font>

1019
01:31:24.207 --> 01:31:25.668
<font color="#ffff00">-You need to leave.
-Yeah, I do.</font>

1020
01:31:25.752 --> 01:31:27.205
<font color="#ffff00">But first...</font>

1021
01:31:27.289 --> 01:31:29.152
<font color="#ffff00">I owe all these folks an apology.</font>

1022
01:31:29.236 --> 01:31:32.001
<font color="#ffff00">I think that by lending my cachet
to this joint</font>

1023
01:31:32.085 --> 01:31:34.983
<font color="#ffff00">I might have made it seem
as if Biosyn wasn't rotten to the core.</font>

1024
01:31:35.067 --> 01:31:37.252
<font color="#ffff00">-That's enough, Ian.
-See, that's how they get ya.</font>

1025
01:31:37.338 --> 01:31:39.830
<font color="#ffff00">They give you so many promotions
in the short period of time.</font>

1026
01:31:39.914 --> 01:31:42.070
<font color="#ffff00">that it bludgeons your capacity
for critical thinking.</font>

1027
01:31:42.154 --> 01:31:42.988
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God.</font>

1028
01:31:43.072 --> 01:31:45.110
<font color="#ffff00">So, then there are doors
that you don't open.</font>

1029
01:31:45.194 --> 01:31:46.387
<font color="#ffff00">Things that you ignore.</font>

1030
01:31:46.471 --> 01:31:49.935
<font color="#ffff00">But mainly, he's exploiting
your enchantment</font>

1031
01:31:50.963 --> 01:31:51.815
<font color="#ffff00">with these.</font>

1032
01:31:51.899 --> 01:31:54.217
<font color="#ffff00">Is there an actual concern here?
Or you just--</font>

1033
01:31:54.301 --> 01:31:56.917
<font color="#ffff00">You are racing toward the extinction
of our species,</font>

1034
01:31:57.011 --> 01:31:58.328
<font color="#ffff00">and you don't care.</font>

1035
01:31:58.412 --> 01:32:01.569
<font color="#ffff00">You know exactly what you're doing.
But you won't stop.</font>

1036
01:32:01.653 --> 01:32:02.645
<font color="#ffff00">You can't.</font>

1037
01:32:03.231 --> 01:32:06.384
<font color="#ffff00">I thought you might be different,
but you just like everyone else.</font>

1038
01:32:06.468 --> 01:32:07.571
<font color="#ffff00">You see what you wanna see.</font>

1039
01:32:07.959 --> 01:32:12.245
<font color="#ffff00">You imagine unchecked avarice,
so that's what you find.</font>

1040
01:32:12.329 --> 01:32:17.191
<font color="#ffff00">You envision what, an evil unbound
Prometheus, so that what I am to you?</font>

1041
01:32:17.275 --> 01:32:18.765
<font color="#ffff00">Prometheus got gored.</font>

1042
01:32:18.850 --> 01:32:21.681
<font color="#ffff00">So will you, you rapacious rat bastard.</font>

1043
01:32:21.765 --> 01:32:25.563
<font color="#ffff00">Ramsay, would you help
Dr. Malcolm gather his things?</font>

1044
01:32:26.498 --> 01:32:28.660
<font color="#ffff00">His room and then to the airfield.
That's it.</font>

1045
01:32:38.693 --> 01:32:39.787
<font color="#ffff00">Dodgson.</font>

1046
01:34:13.720 --> 01:34:14.931
<font color="#ffff00">Allosaurus?</font>

1047
01:34:16.318 --> 01:34:17.562
<font color="#ffff00">Giganotosaurus.</font>

1048
01:34:18.416 --> 01:34:20.125
<font color="#ffff00">Largest known terrestrial carnivore.</font>

1049
01:34:20.929 --> 01:34:23.247
<font color="#ffff00">He put two apex predators in one valley.</font>

1050
01:34:23.533 --> 01:34:25.172
<font color="#ffff00">Pretty soon there's only gonna be one.</font>

1051
01:34:57.434 --> 01:34:58.598
<font color="#ffff00">Did you feel that?</font>

1052
01:35:00.418 --> 01:35:01.823
<font color="#ffff00">That's an air current.</font>

1053
01:35:02.351 --> 01:35:03.819
<font color="#ffff00">Must be an opening up ahead.</font>

1054
01:35:05.249 --> 01:35:06.848
<font color="#ffff00">How old is this mine do you think?</font>

1055
01:35:07.558 --> 01:35:08.686
<font color="#ffff00">Just breathe.</font>

1056
01:35:09.474 --> 01:35:11.527
<font color="#ffff00">Nobody panic. Just watch out for bats.</font>

1057
01:35:11.617 --> 01:35:13.415
<font color="#ffff00">-Who said anything about bats?
-I hate bats.</font>

1058
01:35:13.523 --> 01:35:15.967
<font color="#ffff00">There's probably no bats.
No falling rocks.</font>

1059
01:35:16.849 --> 01:35:19.793
<font color="#ffff00">Just a possibility of toxic gas,
dehydration, hypothermia.</font>

1060
01:35:19.880 --> 01:35:22.147
<font color="#ffff00">Just possibilities, nothing for certain.</font>

1061
01:35:22.231 --> 01:35:25.188
<font color="#ffff00">I should've left you where you were.
Why did I bring you into this?</font>

1062
01:35:25.272 --> 01:35:26.786
<font color="#ffff00">You were happy in your element.</font>

1063
01:35:26.870 --> 01:35:27.704
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

1064
01:35:27.788 --> 01:35:29.066
<font color="#ffff00">-Ellie.
-What?</font>

1065
01:35:30.200 --> 01:35:31.141
<font color="#ffff00">I wasn't happy.</font>

1066
01:35:32.979 --> 01:35:33.863
<font color="#ffff00">You weren't?</font>

1067
01:35:33.947 --> 01:35:35.162
<font color="#ffff00">Do you have kids?</font>

1068
01:35:35.694 --> 01:35:36.562
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

1069
01:35:38.066 --> 01:35:40.271
<font color="#ffff00">No. I do. Two.</font>

1070
01:35:41.171 --> 01:35:42.232
<font color="#ffff00">But not with him?</font>

1071
01:35:45.610 --> 01:35:46.646
<font color="#ffff00">No.</font>

1072
01:35:47.387 --> 01:35:49.651
<font color="#ffff00">No, just old friends.</font>

1073
01:35:50.192 --> 01:35:52.161
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, just old friends.</font>

1074
01:35:53.382 --> 01:35:54.356
<font color="#ffff00">Really?</font>

1075
01:35:59.530 --> 01:36:01.478
<font color="#ffff00">Won't be long
before security knows you're gone.</font>

1076
01:36:02.233 --> 01:36:05.188
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, map. That looks like an old map.
Do you have a new map?</font>

1077
01:36:05.272 --> 01:36:07.770
<font color="#ffff00">There's an access gate
to the north-east corner of the mine.</font>

1078
01:36:07.854 --> 01:36:09.372
<font color="#ffff00">-If your friends make it out.
-If?</font>

1079
01:36:09.965 --> 01:36:12.075
<font color="#ffff00">When they make it out,
that's where they'll be.</font>

1080
01:36:13.321 --> 01:36:15.155
<font color="#ffff00">These roads are protected, right?</font>

1081
01:36:15.955 --> 01:36:17.023
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, drive fast.</font>

1082
01:36:28.664 --> 01:36:29.761
<font color="#ffff00">You did good.</font>

1083
01:36:30.273 --> 01:36:33.372
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, well... Actually,
it's a complete disaster, but thanks.</font>

1084
01:36:34.367 --> 01:36:35.281
<font color="#ffff00">Not yet.</font>

1085
01:36:46.645 --> 01:36:47.679
<font color="#ffff00">Watch yourself.</font>

1086
01:37:07.130 --> 01:37:08.518
<font color="#ffff00">-Ellie.
-Yeah.</font>

1087
01:37:13.873 --> 01:37:14.851
<font color="#ffff00">What was that?</font>

1088
01:37:22.258 --> 01:37:23.259
<font color="#ffff00">Careful.</font>

1089
01:37:37.700 --> 01:37:39.268
<font color="#ffff00">-Oh, my God!
-Are you okay?</font>

1090
01:37:57.740 --> 01:37:59.141
<font color="#ffff00">Forget the hat!</font>

1091
01:38:01.198 --> 01:38:02.105
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>

1092
01:38:11.794 --> 01:38:12.862
<font color="#ffff00">Go, go!</font>

1093
01:38:18.646 --> 01:38:19.980
<font color="#ffff00">It's a car.</font>

1094
01:38:21.704 --> 01:38:23.501
<font color="#ffff00">-God, Ian!
-In here! Over here.</font>

1095
01:38:24.796 --> 01:38:25.833
<font color="#ffff00">-In here!
-Come on, Ian!</font>

1096
01:38:25.917 --> 01:38:27.859
<font color="#ffff00">-Open the gate!
-Please help us.</font>

1097
01:38:28.707 --> 01:38:29.936
<font color="#ffff00">-Do you know the code?</font>

1098
01:38:30.020 --> 01:38:31.745
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't know there was gonna be a code.</font>

1099
01:38:32.739 --> 01:38:34.581
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't know there was gonna be a code.</font>

1100
01:38:35.508 --> 01:38:37.124
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God! Oh, my God!</font>

1101
01:38:38.725 --> 01:38:40.563
<font color="#ffff00">The brake, pull the break!</font>

1102
01:38:40.648 --> 01:38:41.799
<font color="#ffff00">There's 10,000 possibilities.</font>

1103
01:38:41.883 --> 01:38:43.266
<font color="#ffff00">Push with your legs! That's it.</font>

1104
01:38:44.908 --> 01:38:47.366
<font color="#ffff00">-1984.
-Come on, Ian!</font>

1105
01:38:47.450 --> 01:38:49.906
<font color="#ffff00">-Here come again!
-Hurry!</font>

1106
01:38:49.990 --> 01:38:53.063
<font color="#ffff00">Miles Davis' birthday, 0526.</font>

1107
01:38:58.376 --> 01:39:00.909
<font color="#ffff00">-Ian, do something!
-Please, please!</font>

1108
01:39:00.993 --> 01:39:02.260
<font color="#ffff00">We're not gonna make it.</font>

1109
01:39:02.344 --> 01:39:04.301
<font color="#ffff00">Let's all try and stay positive.</font>

1110
01:39:20.654 --> 01:39:23.673
<font color="#ffff00">-Please.
-I know. I know.</font>

1111
01:39:30.296 --> 01:39:31.356
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God!</font>

1112
01:39:33.450 --> 01:39:35.092
<font color="#ffff00">What do you know,
it actually worked.</font>

1113
01:39:41.054 --> 01:39:43.315
<font color="#ffff00">-Ian, this is Maisie.
-Hi, Maisie.</font>

1114
01:39:43.881 --> 01:39:45.423
<font color="#ffff00">We got the DNA.</font>

1115
01:39:46.667 --> 01:39:48.181
<font color="#ffff00">We need to get out of this valley.</font>

1116
01:39:48.265 --> 01:39:50.385
<font color="#ffff00">-Yeah, let's go.
-Come on.</font>

1117
01:40:21.703 --> 01:40:23.236
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, come on.</font>

1118
01:41:33.300 --> 01:41:34.501
<font color="#ffff00">Go on! Get.</font>

1119
01:41:37.903 --> 01:41:38.830
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

1120
01:41:38.914 --> 01:41:39.821
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God.</font>

1121
01:41:41.684 --> 01:41:42.979
<font color="#ffff00">I thought you were dead.</font>

1122
01:41:43.063 --> 01:41:44.220
<font color="#ffff00">What do they even eat?</font>

1123
01:41:49.432 --> 01:41:50.933
<font color="#ffff00">We better get inside.</font>

1124
01:42:05.206 --> 01:42:06.435
<font color="#ffff00">LOCUST PLAGUE JUMPS CONTINENTS</font>

1125
01:42:06.519 --> 01:42:07.716
<font color="#ffff00">WHERE DID THEY COME FROM?</font>

1126
01:42:32.011 --> 01:42:33.364
<font color="#ffff00">Go ahead.</font>

1127
01:43:12.723 --> 01:43:14.571
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Containment chamber is compromised.</i></font>

1128
01:43:30.659 --> 01:43:31.789
<font color="#ffff00">It's locked.</font>

1129
01:43:31.880 --> 01:43:34.205
<font color="#ffff00">That'll need something heavy,
something sharp, or both.</font>

1130
01:43:45.965 --> 01:43:48.436
<font color="#ffff00">That can't be right.</font>

1131
01:44:00.458 --> 01:44:02.053
<font color="#ffff00">-Is that..?
-Oh, no.</font>

1132
01:44:02.453 --> 01:44:03.748
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God.</font>

1133
01:44:06.383 --> 01:44:07.843
<font color="#ffff00">He's burning the evidence.</font>

1134
01:44:09.031 --> 01:44:10.518
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God. Oh, my God.</font>

1135
01:44:10.603 --> 01:44:11.960
<font color="#ffff00">That's bananas.</font>

1136
01:44:28.466 --> 01:44:29.507
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1137
01:44:30.131 --> 01:44:31.134
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God.</font>

1138
01:44:31.663 --> 01:44:35.546
<font color="#ffff00">I know how this may seem
precarious, but...</font>

1139
01:44:37.510 --> 01:44:39.132
<font color="#ffff00">No, we're teetering.</font>

1140
01:44:41.337 --> 01:44:43.674
<font color="#ffff00">Should we all
lean to the left or something?</font>

1141
01:44:43.758 --> 01:44:45.680
<font color="#ffff00">That's a very constructive.
Thank you, Maisie.</font>

1142
01:44:47.313 --> 01:44:49.242
<font color="#ffff00">Slow. Slow.</font>

1143
01:44:51.496 --> 01:44:52.497
<font color="#ffff00">Slow.</font>

1144
01:44:56.606 --> 01:44:57.662
<font color="#ffff00">We're fine.</font>

1145
01:44:58.189 --> 01:44:59.417
<font color="#ffff00">See this?</font>

1146
01:45:00.339 --> 01:45:01.554
<font color="#ffff00">This is fine.</font>

1147
01:45:15.836 --> 01:45:18.164
<font color="#ffff00">Alan? Alan!</font>

1148
01:45:19.566 --> 01:45:20.714
<font color="#ffff00">How's everybody?</font>

1149
01:45:31.067 --> 01:45:34.664
<font color="#ffff00">It's my parents! Help!</font>

1150
01:45:35.375 --> 01:45:36.407
<font color="#ffff00">Help!</font>

1151
01:45:36.498 --> 01:45:37.470
<font color="#ffff00">Listen.</font>

1152
01:45:45.379 --> 01:45:46.443
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my God!</font>

1153
01:45:47.170 --> 01:45:48.347
<font color="#ffff00">You're okay.</font>

1154
01:45:49.481 --> 01:45:50.443
<font color="#ffff00">You're okay.</font>

1155
01:45:50.957 --> 01:45:53.663
<font color="#ffff00">You came to get me.
You actually came to get me.</font>

1156
01:45:53.909 --> 01:45:56.121
<font color="#ffff00">Of course we did, sweetheart.</font>

1157
01:45:56.205 --> 01:45:58.060
<font color="#ffff00">-Hey, kiddo.
-Of course.</font>

1158
01:46:00.034 --> 01:46:01.548
<font color="#ffff00">I remember you.</font>

1159
01:46:03.176 --> 01:46:04.538
<font color="#ffff00">I remember you too.</font>

1160
01:46:15.378 --> 01:46:16.747
<font color="#ffff00">They helped me escape.</font>

1161
01:46:21.990 --> 01:46:23.484
<font color="#ffff00">You okay?</font>

1162
01:46:26.289 --> 01:46:27.557
<font color="#ffff00">-Thank you.
-Yeah.</font>

1163
01:46:30.352 --> 01:46:31.767
<font color="#ffff00">We gotta go.</font>

1164
01:46:32.475 --> 01:46:34.849
<font color="#ffff00">Gonna have to break the window
to get inside that thing.</font>

1165
01:46:35.817 --> 01:46:37.574
<font color="#ffff00">Hope nobody's afraid of heights.</font>

1166
01:46:50.576 --> 01:46:52.595
<font color="#ffff00">-Don't move.
-Don't move.</font>

1167
01:47:10.846 --> 01:47:12.113
<font color="#ffff00">What is that?</font>

1168
01:47:12.795 --> 01:47:14.449
<font color="#ffff00">Giganotosaurus.</font>

1169
01:47:16.633 --> 01:47:18.604
<font color="#ffff00">Biggest carnivore the world has ever seen.</font>

1170
01:47:31.584 --> 01:47:32.550
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1171
01:47:37.818 --> 01:47:39.881
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie, look at me. Look at me.</font>

1172
01:48:03.622 --> 01:48:04.515
<font color="#ffff00">Move.</font>

1173
01:48:20.310 --> 01:48:21.873
<font color="#ffff00">-Go, go.
-Come on!</font>

1174
01:48:27.741 --> 01:48:28.811
<font color="#ffff00">No, no!</font>

1175
01:48:33.350 --> 01:48:35.239
<font color="#ffff00">-Hustle.
-I'm gonna die!</font>

1176
01:48:35.577 --> 01:48:36.694
<font color="#ffff00">Climb. Climb, kid.</font>

1177
01:48:36.778 --> 01:48:38.702
<font color="#ffff00">You're not. No, you're not. You're okay.</font>

1178
01:48:47.920 --> 01:48:48.988
<font color="#ffff00">Go, go!</font>

1179
01:49:06.829 --> 01:49:08.118
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1180
01:49:09.420 --> 01:49:10.541
<font color="#ffff00">Hey!</font>

1181
01:49:17.526 --> 01:49:19.061
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yeah, come here.</font>

1182
01:49:36.795 --> 01:49:37.752
<font color="#ffff00">Hit me up.</font>

1183
01:49:43.266 --> 01:49:44.288
<font color="#ffff00">I got ya.</font>

1184
01:49:47.085 --> 01:49:48.326
<font color="#ffff00">Go, go!</font>

1185
01:49:51.903 --> 01:49:52.774
<font color="#ffff00">Run!</font>

1186
01:50:09.152 --> 01:50:10.948
<font color="#ffff00">See, not so bad.</font>

1187
01:50:17.602 --> 01:50:18.490
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1188
01:50:20.998 --> 01:50:22.073
<font color="#ffff00">Claire!</font>

1189
01:51:04.805 --> 01:51:06.280
<font color="#ffff00">Call in evacuation.</font>

1190
01:51:06.500 --> 01:51:07.978
<font color="#ffff00">We need to bring the animals inside.</font>

1191
01:51:08.062 --> 01:51:10.988
<font color="#ffff00">The regulations are clear
that in the event of a level--</font>

1192
01:51:14.111 --> 01:51:15.002
<font color="#ffff00">Jeffrey.</font>

1193
01:51:20.489 --> 01:51:22.982
<font color="#ffff00">Goddamnit!</font>

1194
01:51:25.786 --> 01:51:26.620
<font color="#ffff00">Just...</font>

1195
01:51:28.369 --> 01:51:29.457
<font color="#ffff00">Just call it.</font>

1196
01:51:30.265 --> 01:51:33.935
<font color="#ffff00">Attention! Attention!
This is an immediate evacuation order.</font>

1197
01:51:34.020 --> 01:51:35.933
<font color="#ffff00">Remote herding system is now active.</font>

1198
01:51:36.051 --> 01:51:39.550
<font color="#ffff00">All living assets en route
to emergency containment.</font>

1199
01:52:02.330 --> 01:52:06.394
<font color="#ffff00">I can't get hold of anybody
since everything is on fire.</font>

1200
01:52:06.891 --> 01:52:09.258
<font color="#ffff00">-Dr. Sattler, get some water.
-Thanks.</font>

1201
01:52:09.342 --> 01:52:11.557
<font color="#ffff00">Dr. Grant, yours.</font>

1202
01:52:11.641 --> 01:52:13.129
<font color="#ffff00">I'm Owen Grady.</font>

1203
01:52:13.213 --> 01:52:16.547
<font color="#ffff00">Big fan, I've read your book.
Well, book on tape.</font>

1204
01:52:16.634 --> 01:52:18.964
<font color="#ffff00">Owen Grady. Owen Grady.</font>

1205
01:52:19.049 --> 01:52:20.436
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I know who you are.</font>

1206
01:52:21.244 --> 01:52:23.477
<font color="#ffff00">You trained Raptors.</font>

1207
01:52:24.021 --> 01:52:25.836
<font color="#ffff00">I tried. Yeah.</font>

1208
01:52:26.191 --> 01:52:28.843
<font color="#ffff00">-How are you doing?
-One here.</font>

1209
01:52:29.423 --> 01:52:31.820
<font color="#ffff00">You were at Jurassic World.</font>

1210
01:52:31.904 --> 01:52:33.169
<font color="#ffff00">Jurassic World?</font>

1211
01:52:33.516 --> 01:52:34.663
<font color="#ffff00">Not a fan.</font>

1212
01:52:36.380 --> 01:52:39.562
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, so, we're good
to find a way outta here?</font>

1213
01:52:39.653 --> 01:52:40.539
<font color="#ffff00">Yep.</font>

1214
01:52:40.623 --> 01:52:42.013
<font color="#ffff00">Let's get it.</font>

1215
01:52:42.098 --> 01:52:45.302
<font color="#ffff00">There's a helicopter
out in the main complex.</font>

1216
01:52:45.386 --> 01:52:47.939
<font color="#ffff00">We turn the ADS back on, we go home.</font>

1217
01:52:48.023 --> 01:52:49.492
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, what's an ADS?</font>

1218
01:52:49.625 --> 01:52:50.933
<font color="#ffff00">Aerial deterrent system.</font>

1219
01:52:52.348 --> 01:52:56.288
<font color="#ffff00">You know, for the pterodactyls and shit.
Keeps them away from the helicopters.</font>

1220
01:52:57.090 --> 01:52:58.536
<font color="#ffff00">How do we turn it back on?</font>

1221
01:52:58.620 --> 01:53:01.356
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, it looks like all the systems
run through the control room</font>

1222
01:53:01.463 --> 01:53:02.800
<font color="#ffff00">which is on the third floor,</font>

1223
01:53:04.222 --> 01:53:06.496
<font color="#ffff00">And these outposts
are all connected underground.</font>

1224
01:53:12.017 --> 01:53:13.034
<font color="#ffff00">All right, easy, Rambo.</font>

1225
01:53:23.966 --> 01:53:26.023
<font color="#ffff00">So, you worked in the Raptor pan, huh?</font>

1226
01:53:26.691 --> 01:53:27.896
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1227
01:53:28.320 --> 01:53:32.849
<font color="#ffff00">Wow, and what happens, you just tell them
what to do and they comply or...</font>

1228
01:53:33.977 --> 01:53:37.672
<font color="#ffff00">Well, that's a human-animal bond
based on mutual respect.</font>

1229
01:53:40.139 --> 01:53:41.560
<font color="#ffff00">I had a dog once.</font>

1230
01:53:42.528 --> 01:53:46.806
<font color="#ffff00">Humped my leg so much
I got a callus on my shinbone.</font>

1231
01:53:47.403 --> 01:53:48.617
<font color="#ffff00">It's a true story.</font>

1232
01:54:01.907 --> 01:54:03.403
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, God. Hey.</font>

1233
01:54:03.790 --> 01:54:04.757
<font color="#ffff00">Good.</font>

1234
01:54:06.439 --> 01:54:07.813
<font color="#ffff00">Here's what I'm thinking.</font>

1235
01:54:07.910 --> 01:54:09.941
<font color="#ffff00">We get started again, you and me.</font>

1236
01:54:10.356 --> 01:54:11.724
<font color="#ffff00">I can get money.</font>

1237
01:54:13.079 --> 01:54:15.269
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah. Money's cheap these days.</font>

1238
01:54:15.362 --> 01:54:17.685
<font color="#ffff00">What's the matter? Don't look so worried.</font>

1239
01:54:18.531 --> 01:54:21.631
<font color="#ffff00">There's opportunity in everything,
even this.</font>

1240
01:54:21.718 --> 01:54:23.349
<font color="#ffff00">You'll learn that.</font>

1241
01:54:23.433 --> 01:54:24.550
<font color="#ffff00">I've been thinking...</font>

1242
01:54:25.385 --> 01:54:27.534
<font color="#ffff00">Maybe you take more
of a lead now, okay?</font>

1243
01:54:28.121 --> 01:54:29.243
<font color="#ffff00">You're ready I think.</font>

1244
01:54:29.716 --> 01:54:31.258
<font color="#ffff00">Here. Take it.</font>

1245
01:54:31.691 --> 01:54:33.387
<font color="#ffff00">What the hell is the matter with you?</font>

1246
01:54:42.739 --> 01:54:43.936
<font color="#ffff00">It was you.</font>

1247
01:54:44.571 --> 01:54:46.839
<font color="#ffff00">You told Malcolm about the program. You...</font>

1248
01:54:48.052 --> 01:54:50.826
<font color="#ffff00">You set this whole thing up.
You set me up?</font>

1249
01:54:51.700 --> 01:54:53.953
<font color="#ffff00">I gave you every opportunity
I did not have. I...</font>

1250
01:54:55.621 --> 01:54:57.984
<font color="#ffff00">We have an understanding, Ramsay,</font>

1251
01:54:58.605 --> 01:55:00.133
<font color="#ffff00">and you do not break that.</font>

1252
01:55:03.007 --> 01:55:04.842
<font color="#ffff00">I would not break this.</font>

1253
01:55:07.997 --> 01:55:08.958
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not you.</font>

1254
01:55:24.445 --> 01:55:25.743
<font color="#ffff00">This is very bad.</font>

1255
01:55:27.957 --> 01:55:30.244
<font color="#ffff00">This is the same system
we used at the park.</font>

1256
01:55:30.328 --> 01:55:34.952
<font color="#ffff00">Great, so we can turn on the thing
and then we all get out of here?</font>

1257
01:55:35.036 --> 01:55:36.697
<font color="#ffff00">Let me see. ADS</font>

1258
01:55:37.864 --> 01:55:39.922
<font color="#ffff00">What's this? What's "Error 99"?</font>

1259
01:55:40.006 --> 01:55:41.040
<font color="#ffff00">Not enough power.</font>

1260
01:55:41.878 --> 01:55:43.336
<font color="#ffff00">In a breakdown all available power</font>

1261
01:55:43.427 --> 01:55:45.375
<font color="#ffff00">is seized by the primary system
to keep running.</font>

1262
01:55:45.935 --> 01:55:48.032
<font color="#ffff00">We need all that power
to re-activate the ADS.</font>

1263
01:55:48.116 --> 01:55:50.902
<font color="#ffff00">So, the system safety feature
is what's gonna kill us?</font>

1264
01:55:50.986 --> 01:55:51.853
<font color="#ffff00">Of course.</font>

1265
01:55:51.937 --> 01:55:53.134
<font color="#ffff00">How do we get more power?</font>

1266
01:55:53.218 --> 01:55:55.664
<font color="#ffff00">We can't. But we can re-distribute
what we have, if we just...</font>

1267
01:55:55.748 --> 01:55:57.653
<font color="#ffff00">-Just need to--
-Shut down the primary system.</font>

1268
01:55:57.737 --> 01:55:59.234
<font color="#ffff00">-Yes, exactly.
-Where is it?</font>

1269
01:55:59.319 --> 01:56:01.203
<font color="#ffff00">-Next floor up.
-I'm coming with you.</font>

1270
01:56:01.294 --> 01:56:02.551
<font color="#ffff00">We escaped down here.</font>

1271
01:56:03.892 --> 01:56:05.391
<font color="#ffff00">Where is that? Water Treatment Center.</font>

1272
01:56:05.475 --> 01:56:07.111
<font color="#ffff00">Hydroelectric system, Sub 8.</font>

1273
01:56:07.195 --> 01:56:08.934
<font color="#ffff00">Give me eight minutes, I could find her.</font>

1274
01:56:09.018 --> 01:56:10.989
<font color="#ffff00">-Wait, who's this now?
-Beta.</font>

1275
01:56:11.730 --> 01:56:13.638
<font color="#ffff00">-Blue's baby.
-Velociraptor.</font>

1276
01:56:14.171 --> 01:56:15.926
<font color="#ffff00">-What?
-A baby Raptor?</font>

1277
01:56:16.010 --> 01:56:17.789
<font color="#ffff00">And you gave her a name, how about that.</font>

1278
01:56:17.873 --> 01:56:19.518
<font color="#ffff00">I made a promise we would bring her home.</font>

1279
01:56:19.602 --> 01:56:21.803
<font color="#ffff00">You made a promise to a dinosaur.</font>

1280
01:56:22.623 --> 01:56:23.918
<font color="#ffff00">You're coming with us, right?</font>

1281
01:56:24.738 --> 01:56:25.655
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie...</font>

1282
01:56:25.739 --> 01:56:26.714
<font color="#ffff00">Please.</font>

1283
01:56:30.154 --> 01:56:32.113
<font color="#ffff00">-We'll be on channel 5.
-Okay.</font>

1284
01:56:32.197 --> 01:56:33.134
<font color="#ffff00">We're on 3.</font>

1285
01:56:34.956 --> 01:56:35.872
<font color="#ffff00">Come back.</font>

1286
01:56:36.674 --> 01:56:37.901
<font color="#ffff00">I always come back.</font>

1287
01:56:39.319 --> 01:56:42.141
<font color="#ffff00">I'll have that chopper hot in ten,
wait for my signal.</font>

1288
01:56:44.022 --> 01:56:48.519
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Evacuation Phase Four complete.
All living assets are now in containment.</i></font>

1289
01:56:57.434 --> 01:56:58.447
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1290
01:57:11.069 --> 01:57:12.363
<font color="#ffff00">Still get nightmares?</font>

1291
01:57:13.073 --> 01:57:14.197
<font color="#ffff00">All of the time.</font>

1292
01:57:15.104 --> 01:57:15.946
<font color="#ffff00">You?</font>

1293
01:57:17.367 --> 01:57:18.768
<font color="#ffff00">I have a lot of regrets.</font>

1294
01:57:19.483 --> 01:57:20.471
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yeah?</font>

1295
01:57:22.041 --> 01:57:22.905
<font color="#ffff00">Well...</font>

1296
01:57:23.953 --> 01:57:26.909
<font color="#ffff00">We hold on to regret we stay in the past.</font>

1297
01:57:30.609 --> 01:57:32.562
<font color="#ffff00">What matters, I guess, is...</font>

1298
01:57:34.094 --> 01:57:36.504
<font color="#ffff00">Is what we do now, right?</font>

1299
01:57:37.231 --> 01:57:38.259
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1300
01:57:55.402 --> 01:57:57.242
<font color="#ffff00">Nobody said there'll be bugs.</font>

1301
01:57:59.496 --> 01:58:01.598
<font color="#ffff00">B4. She's in here.</font>

1302
01:58:02.285 --> 01:58:03.817
<font color="#ffff00">Watch the sides.</font>

1303
01:58:04.370 --> 01:58:06.072
<font color="#ffff00">They always come from the sides.</font>

1304
01:58:08.251 --> 01:58:09.536
<font color="#ffff00">You know, at first we thought...</font>

1305
01:58:11.289 --> 01:58:14.386
<font color="#ffff00">they disembowel their prey, but now...</font>

1306
01:58:15.258 --> 01:58:17.560
<font color="#ffff00">They're smart enough
to go straight to the throat.</font>

1307
01:58:18.729 --> 01:58:20.366
<font color="#ffff00">Veins, the arteries.</font>

1308
01:58:21.523 --> 01:58:23.621
<font color="#ffff00">Sometimes both at the same time.</font>

1309
01:58:23.715 --> 01:58:24.856
<font color="#ffff00">Okay.</font>

1310
01:58:26.642 --> 01:58:27.799
<font color="#ffff00">Okay.</font>

1311
01:58:27.883 --> 01:58:29.961
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We've got you. It's right down that isle.</i></font>

1312
01:58:30.045 --> 01:58:31.727
<font color="#ffff00"><i>It's right down that isle where you are.</i></font>

1313
01:58:32.798 --> 01:58:35.644
<font color="#ffff00">Why are they skulking?
You can sprint right for it.</font>

1314
01:58:35.728 --> 01:58:37.561
<font color="#ffff00">Okay. Here it is.</font>

1315
01:58:37.645 --> 01:58:40.128
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, it'll be a yellow button
on the grid of six.</font>

1316
01:58:40.212 --> 01:58:42.952
<font color="#ffff00"><i>There's a green button.
Do you see a green button?</i></font>

1317
01:58:43.042 --> 01:58:46.016
<font color="#ffff00">It's not the green button,
it's fourth from the bottom.</font>

1318
01:58:46.100 --> 01:58:47.460
<font color="#ffff00">Whoa, whoa...</font>

1319
01:58:47.544 --> 01:58:48.407
<font color="#ffff00">Fourth one up?</font>

1320
01:58:48.492 --> 01:58:50.193
<font color="#ffff00">Third one down or fourth one up.
Same thing.</font>

1321
01:58:50.277 --> 01:58:51.681
<font color="#ffff00">Ian, be specific.</font>

1322
01:58:56.726 --> 01:58:57.707
<font color="#ffff00">She was here.</font>

1323
01:58:58.528 --> 01:58:59.576
<font color="#ffff00">Lights off.</font>

1324
01:59:06.305 --> 01:59:08.606
<font color="#ffff00">I don't know how I could possibly
be more specific</font>

1325
01:59:08.690 --> 01:59:13.104
<font color="#ffff00">other than to say that the one you want
is marked with E1.</font>

1326
01:59:15.096 --> 01:59:15.977
<font color="#ffff00">-E1.
-Okay.</font>

1327
01:59:16.830 --> 01:59:17.798
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1328
01:59:22.968 --> 01:59:25.176
<font color="#ffff00">No. No, no.</font>

1329
01:59:31.726 --> 01:59:33.034
<font color="#ffff00">Dammit, she's fast.</font>

1330
01:59:36.705 --> 01:59:37.587
<font color="#ffff00">Hey!</font>

1331
01:59:38.761 --> 01:59:39.916
<font color="#ffff00">Eyes on me!</font>

1332
01:59:44.349 --> 01:59:46.597
<font color="#ffff00">I've gotta hit her
on the side of the neck.</font>

1333
01:59:46.681 --> 01:59:48.662
<font color="#ffff00">Maisie, you gonna hold her focused.</font>

1334
01:59:49.173 --> 01:59:51.716
<font color="#ffff00">Grant, we're triangulating.</font>

1335
01:59:58.225 --> 01:59:59.228
<font color="#ffff00">Go.</font>

1336
02:00:28.499 --> 02:00:29.510
<font color="#ffff00">Sorry, girl.</font>

1337
02:00:30.398 --> 02:00:32.067
<font color="#ffff00">I promised your mama I'd get you home.</font>

1338
02:00:33.547 --> 02:00:35.792
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Primary system rebooting.</i></font>

1339
02:00:35.876 --> 02:00:38.317
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, no, no.</font>

1340
02:00:38.401 --> 02:00:39.295
<font color="#ffff00">It's rebooting.</font>

1341
02:00:39.379 --> 02:00:40.751
<font color="#ffff00">No, it shouldn't be doing that.</font>

1342
02:00:52.156 --> 02:00:53.432
<font color="#ffff00">Here, come on, take this.</font>

1343
02:01:09.618 --> 02:01:11.168
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Ian, shut it down!</i></font>

1344
02:01:11.252 --> 02:01:13.224
<font color="#ffff00">We're gonna make it work.
We gonna figure this out.</font>

1345
02:01:13.308 --> 02:01:15.445
<font color="#ffff00">-It's very complex.
-We don't have time for complex!</font>

1346
02:01:21.013 --> 02:01:22.715
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Primary system compromised.</i></font>

1347
02:01:25.234 --> 02:01:26.554
<font color="#ffff00">Wait a minute. Wait a minute.</font>

1348
02:01:26.639 --> 02:01:28.584
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Aerial deterrent system activate.</i></font>

1349
02:01:28.668 --> 02:01:30.129
<font color="#ffff00">Victory. Victory.</font>

1350
02:01:33.593 --> 02:01:34.606
<font color="#ffff00">Damn, that felt good.</font>

1351
02:02:04.027 --> 02:02:05.260
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>

1352
02:02:57.833 --> 02:02:58.840
<font color="#ffff00">What's your story--</font>

1353
02:03:14.531 --> 02:03:16.977
<font color="#ffff00"><i>At Biosyn, we're dedicated to the idea</i></font>

1354
02:03:17.068 --> 02:03:20.745
<font color="#ffff00"><i>that dinosaurs can teach us
more about ourselves.</i></font>

1355
02:03:25.717 --> 02:03:28.299
<font color="#ffff00"><i>All right, Kayla, we're good to go.</i></font>

1356
02:03:38.607 --> 02:03:39.955
<font color="#ffff00">Okay, cutie.</font>

1357
02:03:48.944 --> 02:03:51.119
<font color="#ffff00">-You all right?
-Someday.</font>

1358
02:03:51.306 --> 02:03:52.394
<font color="#ffff00">Hey.</font>

1359
02:04:00.252 --> 02:04:02.124
<font color="#ffff00">I remember you.</font>

1360
02:04:02.208 --> 02:04:03.815
<font color="#ffff00">Please, you have to listen to me.</font>

1361
02:04:03.899 --> 02:04:05.960
<font color="#ffff00">You created an ecological disaster.</font>

1362
02:04:06.044 --> 02:04:07.249
<font color="#ffff00">And I can fix it.</font>

1363
02:04:07.912 --> 02:04:11.184
<font color="#ffff00">Charlotte Lockwood changed every cell
in Maisie's body.</font>

1364
02:04:12.272 --> 02:04:13.373
<font color="#ffff00">It saved her life.</font>

1365
02:04:14.021 --> 02:04:17.227
<font color="#ffff00">If I can understand how Charlotte
rewrote Maisie's DNA</font>

1366
02:04:17.311 --> 02:04:20.717
<font color="#ffff00">I can spread change from one locust
to the entire swarm</font>

1367
02:04:20.822 --> 02:04:22.270
<font color="#ffff00">before it's too late.</font>

1368
02:04:24.451 --> 02:04:26.644
<font color="#ffff00">It's okay. It's okay.</font>

1369
02:04:30.813 --> 02:04:32.286
<font color="#ffff00">It's what she would've wanted.</font>

1370
02:04:35.583 --> 02:04:36.687
<font color="#ffff00">Thank you.</font>

1371
02:04:36.772 --> 02:04:37.980
<font color="#ffff00">No, no, no.</font>

1372
02:04:38.968 --> 02:04:40.508
<font color="#ffff00">No, no.</font>

1373
02:04:41.320 --> 02:04:45.024
<font color="#ffff00">Him? Not him. Not him. It's always him.</font>

1374
02:04:45.805 --> 02:04:46.656
<font color="#ffff00">Every single...</font>

1375
02:04:48.012 --> 02:04:49.941
<font color="#ffff00">Is that a dinosaur on your shoulder?</font>

1376
02:04:50.744 --> 02:04:52.107
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, why?</font>

1377
02:04:53.735 --> 02:04:55.841
<font color="#ffff00"><i>I have air. Meet me in the center.</i></font>

1378
02:04:56.314 --> 02:04:57.415
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, wait. Hey.</font>

1379
02:04:58.014 --> 02:04:59.450
<font color="#ffff00">Do not land in here.</font>

1380
02:04:59.534 --> 02:05:01.587
<font color="#ffff00">I don't have a choice, dude.
The valley isn't safe.</font>

1381
02:05:01.671 --> 02:05:03.496
<font color="#ffff00">No, they're not in the valley anymore!</font>

1382
02:06:35.562 --> 02:06:36.565
<font color="#ffff00">This isn't about us.</font>

1383
02:07:08.884 --> 02:07:10.447
<font color="#ffff00">Get up! Come on, come on!</font>

1384
02:07:10.580 --> 02:07:11.550
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1385
02:07:15.128 --> 02:07:16.139
<font color="#ffff00">Come on! Come on!</font>

1386
02:07:21.301 --> 02:07:22.408
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>

1387
02:07:36.636 --> 02:07:37.930
<font color="#ffff00">Ellie, no!</font>

1388
02:08:06.994 --> 02:08:08.795
