1394
02:09:49.108 --> 02:09:51.499
<font color="#ffff00">"Systemic corruption", you got that?
Write that down.</font>

1395
02:09:52.847 --> 02:09:53.943
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, okay.</font>

1396
02:09:54.077 --> 02:09:57.678
<font color="#ffff00">And then we clashed
into this ice lake, right?</font>

1397
02:09:57.762 --> 02:09:59.533
<font color="#ffff00">I mean they literally owe me a plane.</font>

1398
02:09:59.943 --> 02:10:02.421
<font color="#ffff00">I need to get this sample vetted
