1402
02:10:16.469 --> 02:10:18.139
<font color="#ffff00">-Ellie.
-Yeah?</font>

1403
02:10:20.617 --> 02:10:22.307
<font color="#ffff00">I am coming with you.</font>

1404
02:10:33.448 --> 02:10:34.295
<font color="#ffff00">I know.</font>

1405
02:10:34.379 --> 02:10:36.864
<font color="#ffff00">One more minute, then we'll send you home
