1409
02:11:31.405 --> 02:11:32.341
<font color="#ffff00">You look</font>

1410
02:11:33.155 --> 02:11:34.624
<font color="#ffff00">-Untrustable.
-Trustworthy.</font>

1411
02:11:39.840 --> 02:11:42.317
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, not getting used to it.</font>

1412
02:11:44.578 --> 02:11:45.580
<font color="#ffff00">Let's finish this.</font>

1413
02:11:46.517 --> 02:11:47.526
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1414
02:11:51.721 --> 02:11:56.051
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Dr. Henry Wu has found an emergency
solution to the ecological crisis.</i></font>

1415
02:11:56.666 --> 02:11:59.884
<font color="#ffff00"><i>His use of a pathogen
to alter the locusts' DNA</i></font>

1416
02:11:59.968 --> 02:12:02.069
<font color="#ffff00"><i>has revolutionized modern genetics.</i></font>

1417
02:12:02.830 --> 02:12:06.841
<font color="#ffff00"><i>He attributed the discovery
