1421
02:12:50.545 --> 02:12:51.396
<font color="#ffff00">Money?</font>

1422
02:12:51.913 --> 02:12:53.355
<font color="#ffff00">-Money.
-Thank you.</font>

1423
02:14:57.104 --> 02:15:01.103
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Life on Earth has existed
for hundreds of millions of years.</i></font>

1424
02:15:02.164 --> 02:15:04.501
<font color="#ffff00"><i>And dinosaurs were only a part of that.</i></font>

1425
02:15:05.028 --> 02:15:07.223
<font color="#ffff00"><i>And we are an even smaller part of that.</i></font>

1426
02:15:07.843 --> 02:15:10.018
<font color="#ffff00"><i>They really put us in perspective.</i></font>

1427
02:15:11.898 --> 02:15:15.276
<font color="#ffff00"><i>The idea that life on Earth
existed 65 million years ago,</i></font>

1428
02:15:17.024 --> 02:15:18.196
<font color="#ffff00"><i>it's humbling.</i></font>

1429
02:15:19.599 --> 02:15:21.648
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We act like we're along here
but we're not.</i></font>

1430
02:15:22.830 --> 02:15:26.187
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We're a part of a fragile system
